{"id":"0f96c53c-ff96-488c-9b81-833bdb63ccfa","expr":"comment != null && !comment.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method creates a comment event from the provided string, so comment should be non-null and non-empty for a meaningful comment.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxEventHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxEventHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:00.795033342Z"}
