{"id":"7ea3d4bd-f4a4-47c2-84dd-be4c66b6e26f","expr":"result != null && line != null && line.contains(result)","rationale":"At method exit, result is constructed from substrings of line, so line contains result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consumeCommentTokens(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:17.626094579Z"}
{"id":"c9b8afe3-f55e-48c6-878f-00bd579bd213","expr":"result.length() <= line.length()","rationale":"Since result is derived from substrings of line, its length must be less than or equal to that of line.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consumeCommentTokens(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:17.626094579Z"}
{"id":"b8fe7401-ef0c-4132-93a6-82609d2616bc","expr":"result.isEmpty() || result.equals(line)","rationale":"When no comments are found and not inside a comment, the whole line is returned; else the result is empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consumeCommentTokens(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:17.626094579Z"}
