{"id":"04f94c90-d5de-4125-88e1-9233bdc2e5cb","expr":"!line.isEmpty() || line.indexOf('<') == -1","rationale":"Empty line means no characters, so searching any character returns -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consume(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:17.811989265Z"}
{"id":"371d501c-f293-4dd2-b727-59d969de7f5e","expr":"line != null && (line.indexOf(\"<!--\") >= -1)","rationale":"The line may or may not contain comment start tag, indexOf accounts for that.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consume(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:17.811989265Z"}
{"id":"5d08536c-7d11-4505-b6af-e4820cfd90b5","expr":"(result == null) || line.contains(result)","rationale":"From the method implementation, result is line.substring(index) when index != -1, so result must be a substring of line.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consume(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:18.506738627Z"}
