{"id":"7d4c01de-f6b5-48ae-8d85-9d6aa5ca9896","expr":"(result == null) || (line.indexOf(result) >= 0)","rationale":"Substring presence implies indexOf >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#consume(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:18.506738627Z"}
{"id":"062c0c7c-d4a3-4202-9745-3558758fa739","expr":"line != null && line.startsWith(\"<!--\")","rationale":"The method 'startComment' is intended to detect the start of an XML comment, which conventionally starts with \"<!--\". So if 'line' is not null, it typically starts with the comment token.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#startComment(String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:18.727251045Z"}
