{"id":"283f6c36-6640-4d53-9df9-1da162567381","expr":"result == -1 || (result > 0)","rationale":"If the token is found, result is the index plus token length, which is > 0 as token length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#commentToken(String,String,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:21.252932311Z"}
{"id":"e901bab4-e36e-4df4-9a67-e4bdddf89873","expr":"result == -1 || result <= line.length()","rationale":"If the token is found, result is an index in line plus token length, which can't exceed line length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XmlValidationModeDetector#commentToken(String,String,boolean):int","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XmlValidationModeDetector.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:36:21.252932311Z"}
