{"id":"4f90078b-cd9b-4d8d-ac5b-43006fcafe96","expr":"data != null || target != null","rationale":"Since target is typically non-null, data might be null or non-null, but target is not null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.322441151Z"}
{"id":"a29bd597-e81a-4c37-bb33-ac1ad75cb026","expr":"target.length() > 0","rationale":"The target string is expected to be non-empty","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.322441151Z"}
{"id":"ca03a14d-92fc-466a-9824-9b3afd607134","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Data can be null or any string including empty string","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.322441151Z"}
{"id":"c1f0d324-5376-4847-874f-34d90b423090","expr":"target != null","rationale":"Target must be non-null to create the processing instruction","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeProcessingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.322441151Z"}
{"id":"8003d521-6127-4526-bf9a-717af491370f","expr":"dtd != null && !dtd.isEmpty()","rationale":"The parameter dtd passed to writeDTD is likely non-null and not empty, as it represents a DTD string to be written.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.347382540Z"}
{"id":"9dad90db-9bcb-4920-af0d-ff44453b3d37","expr":"dtd.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"The DTD string is not just whitespace; it contains at least one non-whitespace character.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.347382540Z"}
{"id":"96634e3d-f331-4adc-9c4d-aba100a85b94","expr":"dtd.contains(\"[\") || dtd.contains(\">\")","rationale":"The DTD string includes markup delimiters like [ or > indicating validity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:11.347382540Z"}
{"id":"d0b85ea4-1999-43d3-b7d5-fdf5841446d3","expr":"dtd != null && !dtd.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method immediately uses dtd to create a DTD event; it is likely that dtd is non-null and non-empty before calling.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:12.104993361Z"}
{"id":"748fce70-aadb-424b-8cc3-f1a8cb5ae321","expr":"dtd.length() > 0","rationale":"The DTD string length must be greater than zero for meaningful creation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:12.104993361Z"}
{"id":"d5941b43-6b64-4c6e-9768-cb8b36b1a943","expr":"dtd.indexOf('<') == -1","rationale":"The DTD passed is likely a textual string without XML markup characters","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:12.104993361Z"}
{"id":"672219dc-7da6-4f17-8658-0d8e9652f947","expr":"dtd.indexOf('>') > 0","rationale":"A proper DTD string may contain the '>' character as part of its syntax","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.XMLEventStreamWriter#writeDTD(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/XMLEventStreamWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:12.104993361Z"}
