{"id":"57974f15-5e36-4d01-a235-3ceb9ddc3cc1","expr":"name != null && attributes != null && namespaceMapping != null && !namespaceMapping.containsKey(null)","rationale":"The method usage implies none of the parameters are null and namespaceMapping does not contain null keys to avoid NPEs during iteration.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:15.900180536Z"}
