{"id":"85b2991d-56cb-4256-8796-7b5b42834e28","expr":"!namespaceMapping.containsKey(null)","rationale":"Keys in namespaceMapping (prefixes) must be non-null for safe usage.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#startElementInternal(QName,Attributes,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:16.017359418Z"}
{"id":"916373c1-d4d8-48fa-99f9-f54256633f63","expr":"name != null && namespaceMapping != null && !namespaceMapping.isEmpty() && name.getNamespaceURI().equals(namespaceMapping.get(name.getPrefix()))","rationale":"Given the method writes the end element of the QName, namespaceMapping likely contains the prefix mapping, so the QName's namespaceURI equals the mapped prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#endElementInternal(QName,Map<String, String>):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:16.443792178Z"}
