{"id":"6981aff2-1fc6-4a82-a959-f8776c5623a0","expr":"data != null && data.length() >= 0","rationale":"The 'data' parameter must not be null when passed to writeCData, otherwise it throws XMLStreamException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.025654266Z"}
{"id":"355ad0eb-8a89-40bc-90d1-08d3c4f584d7","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Typically, the data passed to writeCData is non-null to avoid exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.025654266Z"}
{"id":"77608fb2-222e-47ee-ba6d-8711410a19f7","expr":"data == null || !data.contains(\"]]> \")","rationale":"CDATA cannot contain ']]>' sequence, so data should not have it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.025654266Z"}
{"id":"bb630a8d-2a29-43e3-8366-94e590c962b5","expr":"data == null || data.length() > 0","rationale":"The method may expect non-empty data to write CDATA, though empty strings allowed by XML.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#cDataInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.025654266Z"}
{"id":"f1a01707-b508-4f4c-ac86-863a848967d4","expr":"data != null","rationale":"Ensures data is non-null for safe writeCharacters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.726575113Z"}
{"id":"9f124f6f-9031-46dd-9a61-13e3b4dc97af","expr":"data.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"Confirms data contains only whitespace or is empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.726575113Z"}
{"id":"3cd82040-5211-478c-bbd9-dccb8154c725","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"Trivial but true invariant about data's length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.726575113Z"}
{"id":"ef7a5b83-f72d-4b7d-9719-54e9008162dd","expr":"data != null && data.length() >= 0","rationale":"The parameter 'data' must be a non-null String to write characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.806566189Z"}
{"id":"5660652e-28fb-4b19-b939-394818f8a110","expr":"data.isEmpty() || data.trim().isEmpty()","rationale":"Data passed here represents ignorable whitespace, thus either empty or whitespace only.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#ignorableWhitespaceInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:19.806566189Z"}
{"id":"a0ef0699-8fe3-4df6-bf55-1596b5826f5e","expr":"dtd != null && !dtd.isEmpty() && dtd.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"The parameter dtd should represent a valid DTD chunk, which is generally expected to be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#dtdInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:20.679138294Z"}
