{"id":"dbdf5b68-4ece-43cc-b7df-e69ec5468824","expr":"comment != null && !comment.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method is expected to write a comment, so the string should be non-null and not empty to be valid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.StaxStreamHandler#commentInternal(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/StaxStreamHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:22.371653228Z"}
