{"id":"f8ac02da-9f2b-4bf8-989d-2bce1aae35ec","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The index parameter is used to get attribute name and namespace, implying it should be a valid non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractXMLStreamReader#getAttributeNamespace(int):String","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractXMLStreamReader.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:28.335822253Z"}
