{"id":"03fdffee-c55a-4943-b786-fff92d4f3690","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.length() >= 0","rationale":"At method exit, the parameter 'prefix' is either null or a valid String with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:57.536329285Z"}
{"id":"37a63f90-6278-4a83-8600-e4baaf507360","expr":"prefix == null || !prefix.isEmpty() || prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"prefix can be null or any string, empty or not.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:57.536329285Z"}
{"id":"770372d1-8922-4b7c-bd3b-842f010abcff","expr":"prefix != null && !prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'prefix' parameter is expected to be a non-null, non-empty string representing a namespace prefix.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:57.852395313Z"}
{"id":"ea87c35b-8814-4ed2-8a35-b5056983cdb2","expr":"prefix == null || prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"It's valid that prefix may be null or empty because no prefix may be associated in some XML contexts.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:57.852395313Z"}
{"id":"27376386-2b2d-4517-89d1-c5485eeb8e4a","expr":"prefix != null","rationale":"Checking prefix nullity is safe and meaningful as the method deals with prefix strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endPrefixMapping(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:57.852395313Z"}
{"id":"ba8576e4-e57b-48e4-8e1e-432b6898731d","expr":"prefix != null && !prefix.isEmpty() || prefix == null || prefix.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method accepts prefix as input; no strong null or emptiness constraint inferred.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:58.255452335Z"}
{"id":"3fe1235d-2c62-43f0-8762-b3d70a9ad4f7","expr":"uri != null && !uri.isEmpty() || uri == null || uri.isEmpty()","rationale":"URI is a string allowed by method signature with no specific constraints inferred.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:58.255452335Z"}
{"id":"d141e93b-7fc7-4645-95ac-90fd52c02402","expr":"prefix == null || uri != null","rationale":"The method likely that mapping prefix to uri implies if there is a prefix, a uri probably exists; conservative check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startPrefixMapping(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:58.255452335Z"}
{"id":"eba305e9-eb1f-47e5-910b-3ee85a25957e","expr":"uri != null && qName != null && localName != null && atts != null","rationale":"Parameters are non-null because interface contract and method usage require.</rationale>","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:59.312416483Z"}
{"id":"17ccaf01-84ee-471d-9182-abfb75b1ebfb","expr":"qName.contains(localName) || localName.equals(\"\")","rationale":"qName often contains the localName as substring or localName can be empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:59.312416483Z"}
{"id":"3b175574-d4eb-42ca-b6db-7fe7f3b20d62","expr":"atts.getLength() >= 0","rationale":"Attributes length is non-negative by contract of Attributes interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:59.312416483Z"}
{"id":"47c8facb-4fdf-4f0b-89a3-278449abbd1a","expr":"localName.length() <= qName.length()","rationale":"Typically localName is a substring or part of qName, so its length is less or equal.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:37:59.312416483Z"}
{"id":"d78f0c06-1809-46d6-bd2e-53a662bafb96","expr":"uri != null && !uri.isEmpty() || qName != null && !qName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because toQName is called with uri and qName, at least one should be non-empty to form a QName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.407066176Z"}
{"id":"7ea1e0bb-f259-4b5c-a877-34fef7bd8408","expr":"atts != null","rationale":"Since atts is passed to startElementInternal, it should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.407066176Z"}
{"id":"3fe5f9c3-5e13-4aa8-b06d-d5956bd5b38e","expr":"qName != null","rationale":"qName is expected to be non-null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.407066176Z"}
{"id":"4cb7adb0-238b-4ecb-801b-af7cb4507db5","expr":"localName != null","rationale":"localName is generally non-null in XML processing.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.407066176Z"}
{"id":"7c5801fd-84c2-4ee2-bc74-6cfe0a3e2f86","expr":"uri != null","rationale":"uri is typically non-null for XML parsing context.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startElement(String,String,String,Attributes):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.407066176Z"}
{"id":"eb1e1bce-00e3-4810-bed5-45ed4fa4b781","expr":"uri != null || qName != null || localName != null","rationale":"Since these are parameters related to XML element names, typically not all are null simultaneously.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.580435365Z"}
{"id":"054618e2-09cb-4271-b401-67e50ba63126","expr":"(qName == null) == (localName == null)","rationale":"Reflects the common relationship between qName and localName in XML parsing.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.580435365Z"}
{"id":"850adce3-ac85-4c36-bf15-6ba750082f3f","expr":"qName == null || qName.length() > 0","rationale":"Qualified name should be non-empty if not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.580435365Z"}
{"id":"9ffdf6ab-15ad-44a6-ad52-921e28af3e10","expr":"uri == null || uri.length() > 0","rationale":"URI parameter represents namespace URIs which are usually non-empty strings when not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.580435365Z"}
{"id":"f554e20c-7734-4e21-a779-e2ab25611d56","expr":"uri != null && (qName == null || qName.contains(localName))","rationale":"qName commonly contains localName when not null, and uri should remain non-null upon method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.787443158Z"}
{"id":"8820e4f5-46f6-42e1-95a3-f13a88c80c1e","expr":"localName != null && !localName.isEmpty()","rationale":"localName should be a meaningful element name, thus non-null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.787443158Z"}
{"id":"8def877e-fccf-436b-9c82-489a8955c4be","expr":"qName == null || qName.startsWith(uri) || qName.contains(localName)","rationale":"qName often includes the namespace URI prefix or localName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.787443158Z"}
{"id":"b7b390b9-32d2-4c60-96f7-d60cde435e5f","expr":"uri.length() <= qName.length() || qName == null","rationale":"If qName is non-null, it should at least be as long as the URI prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endElement(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:00.787443158Z"}
{"id":"9f415120-b823-48cf-8890-01d58f4b5bf7","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The constructor new String(ch, start, length) requires these conditions to avoid exceptions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:01.712369887Z"}
{"id":"afaa5fcf-27ab-4265-b810-f40277b9046a","expr":"start >= 0 && start <= ch.length - length && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"Since the constructor new String(ch, start, length) is called, start and length must be within bounds of ch array length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:01.755250653Z"}
{"id":"a77a77cd-081f-433a-b5dd-0283ee2bddee","expr":"ch != null","rationale":"The method constructs a String with the char array, so ch cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:01.755250653Z"}
{"id":"b891b898-ff0e-43d3-8dd4-14e6056ccede","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Length parameter is used in new String, and must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:01.755250653Z"}
{"id":"faac4ce7-3c9f-4075-a022-eea6ca7e31d9","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Start parameter is used in new String constructor and must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#characters(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:01.755250653Z"}
{"id":"b0c68b67-ceed-4f4b-87d8-9f4afff7ba23","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"start and length indices lie within the bounds of ch array, ensuring valid String construction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:02.390072869Z"}
{"id":"fba4f2af-8b1c-4a94-8d41-8abc9d9dcbb8","expr":"length == 0 || (ch.length > 0)","rationale":"If length is positive, ch array is expected to be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:02.390072869Z"}
{"id":"cabcf31e-a9a3-4221-af55-5c7c0e387f9f","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"start and length form valid indices for substring in ch for new String(ch, start, length).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:03.457566811Z"}
{"id":"9c427969-cd6c-42d5-945f-3907784590bf","expr":"length == 0 || (start >= 0 && (start + length) <= ch.length)","rationale":"Ensures nonnegative length and valid substring range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:03.457566811Z"}
{"id":"b0caf96e-a8e1-4157-bb6f-f484f7828169","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"start is nonnegative as per String(char[], int, int) requirements.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:03.457566811Z"}
{"id":"c1db99bf-5b06-4c97-9300-d2aa1e6a1c78","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"length is nonnegative to avoid errors in String constructor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:03.457566811Z"}
{"id":"811ed9a1-4864-4af0-a09c-99c8ffa234e7","expr":"start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"start + length must not exceed ch array length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#ignorableWhitespace(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:03.457566811Z"}
{"id":"d7c61dec-d9ba-42e5-8b7a-561617584956","expr":"target != null && data != null","rationale":"Likely both target and data are non-null when method exits normally.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:04.142387094Z"}
{"id":"dc7b6325-cd92-4843-9958-98bf4af48bd0","expr":"!target.isEmpty()","rationale":"Target typically is a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:04.142387094Z"}
{"id":"4b82c7c3-b180-41cc-b972-0ffd0f9ea423","expr":"data.length() >= 0","rationale":"data.length() is a valid non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:04.142387094Z"}
{"id":"160fddd9-38a1-4090-a0cb-6267ff3ea921","expr":"!target.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Target should not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:04.142387094Z"}
{"id":"bce5b447-127e-4a4d-8ed9-0edc9dddb106","expr":"target != null && !target.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'target' parameter is usually a meaningful XML processing instruction target and thus expected to be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.065920581Z"}
{"id":"5dba4124-a497-43f6-9ecb-baf3903c044c","expr":"data == null || data.length() >= 0","rationale":"The 'data' parameter can be null or a string; if non-null, its length is at least zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.065920581Z"}
{"id":"758b0fa6-02a7-412c-80f3-0837d4fa0f7d","expr":"(data == null) || (target != null)","rationale":"Data presence implies target presence, reflecting XML processingInstruction semantics.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#processingInstruction(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.065920581Z"}
{"id":"63163095-0381-41c5-b507-f30dfdd5e55f","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The name parameter is expected to be a valid non-null, non-empty string representing the entity to skip.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.530147546Z"}
{"id":"796dc4c1-9e2a-4ee4-9904-a92f0f8ac12e","expr":"name == null || name.length() > 0","rationale":"If name is not null, it should have positive length; otherwise, name might be null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.530147546Z"}
{"id":"11cf7d59-a43a-4a6a-b92e-78225aa503ca","expr":"name != null && name.trim().length() > 0","rationale":"The name parameter is likely to be non-null and contain non-whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.530147546Z"}
{"id":"547e0ed3-ff96-459c-830d-099bc22435b2","expr":"name == null || !name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"If name is non-null, it likely does not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.530147546Z"}
{"id":"932d8e97-dcf3-4693-a1e1-780f8191c8e5","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"It is typical that an entity name passed to skippedEntity is a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.591158479Z"}
{"id":"cb8019e3-e5c5-42f3-90c9-3d0ab7d526d2","expr":"!name.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Entity names in XML cannot contain whitespace; so name should not contain spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#skippedEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:05.591158479Z"}
{"id":"a3383035-b8d4-4ca1-a4af-73598c2efa78","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method appends 'name' to the builder without null checks, so 'name' must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:07.842724930Z"}
{"id":"ea02a34c-cad1-4e20-8ccd-9c64c656e64f","expr":"(publicId == null) || (publicId != null && !publicId.isEmpty())","rationale":"PublicId is nullable but if given, it should be non-empty since it is appended inside quotes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:07.842724930Z"}
{"id":"8106b943-0b36-411e-aef3-ef7feedae3eb","expr":"systemId != null && !systemId.isEmpty()","rationale":"SystemId is passed to builder without null check, so it cannot be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:07.842724930Z"}
{"id":"bd2a4749-cec9-437a-bc4c-d25a404bcb91","expr":"(publicId == null) || (systemId != null)","rationale":"Even when publicId is present, systemId is appended so should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:07.842724930Z"}
{"id":"bc52d896-c144-48db-a96e-3bb254ea9d89","expr":"name.length() > 0","rationale":"The 'name' parameter corresponds to the DOCTYPE name and hence should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:08.641276272Z"}
{"id":"862d51f2-7aab-41f0-96cd-73c0b1d8f2e4","expr":"systemId.length() > 0","rationale":"Since 'systemId' is always appended to the builder, it must be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:08.641276272Z"}
{"id":"974b0d88-7293-4ce6-9971-c7da0d30700c","expr":"publicId == null || publicId.length() > 0","rationale":"If publicId is not null, it should be non-empty for the DOCTYPE declaration to be meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#startDTD(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:08.641276272Z"}
{"id":"eef40457-b60b-4398-a7e6-f95a325d575a","expr":"ch != null && start >= 0 && length >= 0 && start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The String constructor new String(ch, start, length) requires that ch is not null, start and length are non-negative, and the sum does not exceed the array length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#comment(char[],int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:09.350402954Z"}
{"id":"7eceb58e-6197-4fbf-9b68-7d00ccea02a8","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method endEntity is likely called with a valid entity name, so name should neither be null nor empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.xml.AbstractStaxHandler#endEntity(String):void","file":"org/springframework/util/xml/AbstractStaxHandler.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:38:10.754715974Z"}
