{"id":"dcf38e62-32b3-4f94-9673-806e097488f6","expr":"result.startsWith(\"[\") && result.endsWith(\"]\")","rationale":"The method always returns a string enclosed in square brackets.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Collection<Class<?>>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:11.182852336Z"}
