{"id":"16fcc30e-862c-47c4-b44a-d3bd734cf1d2","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a Class<?> array, never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#toClassArray(Collection<Class<?>>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:11.275413859Z"}
{"id":"ae013f34-c6e3-4882-a68a-acff537d7f7e","expr":"result.length == (collection != null ? collection.size() : 0)","rationale":"If collection is non-null and non-empty, the returned array length equals collection.size(). Otherwise, length is zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#toClassArray(Collection<Class<?>>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:11.275413859Z"}
{"id":"87302cb8-92a8-4d4f-ae0e-6ea65da2bf9f","expr":"(collection == null || collection.isEmpty()) == (result.length == 0)","rationale":"The result array is empty iff the collection is null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#toClassArray(Collection<Class<?>>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:11.275413859Z"}
{"id":"83bd1c0a-042c-47a3-a648-281045f11c6d","expr":"classes == null || classes.isEmpty() || !classes.isEmpty()","rationale":"The input Collection classes may be null or empty or non-empty; these predicates cover these cases.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Collection<Class<?>>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:11.325554103Z"}
{"id":"4001e3cb-0bfb-4b35-b144-bc12d4dbcc73","expr":"classes == null || !classes.contains(null)","rationale":"Usually, the Collection<Class<?>> does not contain null entries since Class<?> objects are expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#classNamesToString(Collection<Class<?>>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:11.325554103Z"}
{"id":"fb85f1eb-e4f3-4066-a0ce-795dfbda5847","expr":"instance != null  &&  instance.getClass() != null && instance.getClass().isInterface() == false","rationale":"The method asserts instance is not null before doing anything. The class of an instance is never null. The instance's class cannot be an interface as it's an instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfaces(Object):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:12.486674059Z"}
