{"id":"5000ea34-2810-4116-a0ee-03268ce92cb1","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method uses Assert.notNull to ensure 'instance' is not null, so 'result' of getAllInterfacesForClass(instance.getClass()) should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfaces(Object):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:13.816748257Z"}
{"id":"6e64b634-9906-4f36-89ed-64681070f1bb","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length cannot be negative, trivially true but useful simple invariant.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfaces(Object):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:13.816748257Z"}
{"id":"621293b1-349f-4b5c-a62b-1d04bdea346a","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"Class arrays do not define interfaces directly.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.240190614Z"}
{"id":"e5e76d7d-eb08-4fcd-8b02-fc1d811834ed","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"Java's getInterfaces() method returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.240190614Z"}
{"id":"cae9ccfe-dce5-4763-9fbf-bffeb23bf6e0","expr":"clazz == null || !clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Primitives cannot have interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.240190614Z"}
{"id":"f9938d53-6b03-43e6-88bf-f72521c81147","expr":"instance != null && instance.getClass() != null","rationale":"Ensures instance and its class are non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesAsSet(Object):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.242899619Z"}
{"id":"00ddf7b8-1244-45be-bd9f-15e2d97a263a","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length property","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.385721784Z"}
{"id":"d8d3ad7b-60fb-4a11-9648-3fa633fc5775","expr":"classLoader == null || clazz.getClassLoader() == null || clazz.getClassLoader().equals(classLoader) == false","rationale":"If classLoader is not null and clazz.getClassLoader() is not null, then they are not equal (based on ClassUtils behavior often associating class loading relationships).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.864756402Z"}
{"id":"4dba27b2-586b-464f-9c6d-0feb19c45e00","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"Calling getInterfaces() on a Class object returns a non-null array, useful support for the main method's goal of getting all interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.864756402Z"}
{"id":"22b7144b-c643-4462-8627-b9f074da0a1d","expr":"clazz.getSuperclass() == null || clazz.getSuperclass() != clazz","rationale":"If the class has a superclass, it is not itself (no self-loop). Useful for recursive interface collection logic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.864756402Z"}
{"id":"309b83d4-855b-4bdc-861c-e57ed561922f","expr":"clazz.getPackage() == null || clazz.getPackage().getName() != null","rationale":"If clazz has a package, the package's name is non-null, a basic type property.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClass(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Class<?>[]","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:14.864756402Z"}
{"id":"0618c740-0f8b-41c6-b1c4-caa46fbbd307","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null Set containing the interfaces of the instance's class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesAsSet(Object):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:15.338688734Z"}
{"id":"9a87a939-08cb-4e01-9d59-682b6576ad85","expr":"!result.contains(instance.getClass())","rationale":"The result should not contain the concrete class of the instance, only its interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesAsSet(Object):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:15.338688734Z"}
{"id":"cd898bdc-4ec9-4a12-b40e-2678803a5e1a","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"If clazz is an interface, its implemented interfaces are different; this helps understand the method's expected input.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.731918274Z"}
{"id":"0b0eac32-5236-43a8-98ab-ebbac9b0a120","expr":"clazz.getSuperclass() != clazz","rationale":"By definition, getSuperclass() returns null or a different class, never itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.731918274Z"}
{"id":"63a8de3e-170d-47ea-839e-aa7323dad676","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Primitive types do not implement interfaces, so invariants relate to reference types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.731918274Z"}
{"id":"fb3cec31-2f28-4925-869a-c1456ea2f288","expr":"clazz.isArray() == false","rationale":"Arrays have interfaces, but typically the method is called with classes, not array classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.731918274Z"}
{"id":"8f6bbb70-6c68-4c73-a0a3-8c0b34df6385","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"This is a base property about the Java Class API that is valid at this program point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.731918274Z"}
{"id":"943d570b-9265-4c8a-8ffd-ae6d10c59312","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result set returned by the method is never null, as it is either a singleton set or a LinkedHashSet.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.851708556Z"}
{"id":"1c0e2e5e-63f3-4789-9fd2-fa904edf51f5","expr":"!clazz.isInterface() || (result.size() == 1 && result.contains(clazz))","rationale":"If clazz itself is an interface and visible, the result is singleton containing clazz; otherwise, result contains other interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:16.851708556Z"}
{"id":"8ce92bd1-75ac-4da2-8bb4-029194e942e1","expr":"interfaces != null && interfaces.length > 0","rationale":"The input parameter interfaces must not be empty as per method precondition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#createCompositeInterface(Class<?>[],ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:17.007556659Z"}
{"id":"2f48a8ac-3050-440a-adb3-0bb78e687a4c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a non-null Set containing all interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:17.223235516Z"}
{"id":"2dc45deb-965f-48d6-bc1c-901f2a1ae34f","expr":"!result.contains(null)","rationale":"The set of interfaces should not contain null elements.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:17.223235516Z"}
{"id":"fb4c191b-2ef9-4c6c-8d16-3c553eb3538c","expr":"classLoader == null || (classLoader != null && classLoader.getParent() != null)","rationale":"classLoader is either null or has a parent class loader.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:17.930424259Z"}
{"id":"e4088804-432d-4610-bf9e-2810d59e6e0b","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"The interfaces array for clazz is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getAllInterfacesForClassAsSet(Class<?>,ClassLoader):Set<Class<?>>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:17.930424259Z"}
{"id":"c25a2c46-4766-41d0-aa06-bd06ae6d33e9","expr":"result.isInterface()","rationale":"The resulting class represents a proxy interface and therefore must be an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#createCompositeInterface(Class<?>[],ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:18.453201410Z"}
{"id":"7410cfc0-12ba-4ce2-bf90-61e2c66f837c","expr":"(classLoader == null || result.getClassLoader() == classLoader)","rationale":"If a classLoader is provided to Proxy.getProxyClass, the resulting class's class loader must be that or else null is allowed.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#createCompositeInterface(Class<?>[],ClassLoader):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:18.453201410Z"}
{"id":"e23d825d-96fd-4193-aa55-afecf2c40437","expr":"clazz1 == null || clazz2 == null || !clazz1.isAssignableFrom(clazz2) || !clazz2.isAssignableFrom(clazz1)","rationale":"At method entry, if both clazz1 and clazz2 are non-null, it's not always the case that one is assignable from the other, but the method will check assignability conditions early.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#determineCommonAncestor(Class<?>,Class<?>):Class<?>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:19.867254052Z"}
