{"id":"c99ce891-4f33-4de4-9b3c-571af3717fd3","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName().length() > 0","rationale":"Java classes have a non-empty simple name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:30.716666618Z"}
{"id":"5a7b3efd-6f5a-4af3-94f7-354cef84abfb","expr":"clazz.getPackage() == null || clazz.getPackage().getName() != null","rationale":"Every Class either belongs to a package (with non-null name) or has no package (null).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:30.716666618Z"}
{"id":"0af5afde-2591-4474-80b0-97de6d6a5e1e","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"The method asserts that className has length; result is the short name extracted from it, so result is non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:31.266062656Z"}
{"id":"56db6870-8d7a-4d0b-a82b-72da37bec5ac","expr":"result.indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"The short name does not contain package separators (dots) because substring is after last dot and replaces nested class separators.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:31.266062656Z"}
{"id":"f4cd089a-8e8c-4aa8-a842-265198df7b98","expr":"result.indexOf('$') == -1","rationale":"NESTED_CLASS_SEPARATOR ('$') replaced by PACKAGE_SEPARATOR '.' so no '$' in result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:31.266062656Z"}
{"id":"06f0e824-e84e-40aa-8692-f80df4d89742","expr":"result.equals(className.substring(className.lastIndexOf('.') + 1, (className.indexOf(\"$$\") != -1 ? className.indexOf(\"$$\") : className.length())).replace('$', '.'))","rationale":"result is the substring of className after the last dot up to CGLIB_CLASS_SEPARATOR index with nested class separators replaced by package separators.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:31.266062656Z"}
{"id":"08b891d8-a818-4055-b48a-07b51ab05cde","expr":"className.length() >= result.length()","rationale":"The short name length is at most the className length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:31.266062656Z"}
{"id":"7a89a7ec-d524-4c34-827f-fa5923cd665b","expr":"clazz != null && result != null && result.length() <= clazz.getName().length() && clazz.getName().endsWith(result)","rationale":"result is the short name of clazz, thus result should be a suffix of clazz.getName() and shorter or equal in length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.201986491Z"}
{"id":"2ae6d44f-a7e1-4675-aec1-a131e8eddc50","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"The short name of a class is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.201986491Z"}
{"id":"b4ff72ae-553a-4f07-a9ce-fd0db301ce51","expr":"!result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"The short name shouldn't contain dots because dots appear in qualified names only.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.201986491Z"}
{"id":"43603b4b-b131-4d8d-9ecf-8dda41bd48cc","expr":"clazz.getSimpleName().equals(result)","rationale":"The returned result corresponds to the short name which is the same as clazz.getSimpleName()","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.201986491Z"}
{"id":"f27053ce-1636-41e2-b7e1-87fd3ec4fe8b","expr":"clazz.getName().endsWith(result)","rationale":"The short name should be a suffix of the fully qualified class name","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.201986491Z"}
{"id":"af849b77-5f74-48d0-8480-0c529b5bd4b4","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The 'result' is returned by StringUtils.uncapitalizeAsProperty which never returns null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.710879393Z"}
{"id":"e1e3bce0-2788-4c20-8ff1-c90eb875ec5b","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"The result string should never be empty since getShortName will return a non-empty name and uncapitalizeAsProperty preserves non-emptiness.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.710879393Z"}
{"id":"bbbee698-ab6e-4ac3-9c7b-0bc6bde1598e","expr":"result.length() <= clazz.getSimpleName().length()","rationale":"The returned property name is a form of uncapitalized simple name of the class and thus its length is at most that of simpleName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.710879393Z"}
{"id":"5a8fc16e-309d-4ba8-afa0-b4304699f3a1","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.getSimpleName() != null && clazz.getSimpleName().length() > 0","rationale":"The simple name of clazz must be non-null and non-empty as getShortName eventually uses it.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.759715926Z"}
{"id":"d4b94f93-cc7b-480e-9cd3-4497257cbfbe","expr":"clazz != null && clazz.getName() != null && clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"getShortName is expected to return a substring derived from clazz.getName().","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getShortNameAsProperty(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:32.759715926Z"}
{"id":"d3fb171a-6b5f-4450-b3a6-8ef457734d58","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Method's first statement asserts clazz is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:33.527961999Z"}
{"id":"ac86e31d-0ba4-4473-9a60-99b08e05acde","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Class.getName() returns a non-null string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:33.527961999Z"}
{"id":"5416ae81-18d0-4a11-ab3d-ac615ea5a623","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class.getName() returns the binary name which should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:33.527961999Z"}
{"id":"8d8f66a9-f4d1-40d6-9e7d-b5afea4eae09","expr":"clazz.getName().indexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"To indicate that indexOf returns -1 if not found.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:33.527961999Z"}
{"id":"ff24a65c-3d71-4f24-a64e-428f5d481a67","expr":"result.startsWith(clazz.getSimpleName())","rationale":"The substring of className after last dot is clazz.getSimpleName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:33.973574022Z"}
{"id":"6543b624-fa2e-45ab-804c-fe0743804181","expr":"result.length() > clazz.getSimpleName().length()","rationale":"Because of the suffix appended to the simple name, result length is greater.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getClassFileName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:33.973574022Z"}
{"id":"1c510524-b950-460f-835e-0e74d53d2cb9","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method immediately asserts clazz is not null, so clazz is non-null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:34.489345553Z"}
{"id":"6e69a52a-be97-4871-97f9-cdc0c8bc9579","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"Class.getName() always returns a non-null string, so clazz.getName() is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:34.489345553Z"}
{"id":"05386420-835d-447a-8cc5-e3cadf731720","expr":"clazz.getName().contains(\".\") || !clazz.getName().contains(\"$\")","rationale":"Class names usually contain '.' for packages and '$' for inner classes; at least one condition holds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:34.489345553Z"}
{"id":"6f951a2f-d986-4830-9055-24cee5faf7fd","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Class.getName() returns a non-empty string representing the binary name of the class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:34.489345553Z"}
{"id":"02b4f188-09a7-4e52-b644-2cdf9fb05582","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned package name string is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.019795260Z"}
{"id":"a4490748-651b-4b58-bc86-136cacc850c1","expr":"!result.contains(\" \")","rationale":"The package name should not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.019795260Z"}
{"id":"8e57459c-b4c4-4dcd-8869-131bd9a01f5e","expr":"result.length() <= clazz.getName().length()","rationale":"Result length must be less than or equal to the full class name length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.019795260Z"}
{"id":"b07b53d7-ae5b-4302-8731-1f0b31665eed","expr":"fqClassName != null && fqClassName.length() > 0","rationale":"The method asserts fqClassName is not null, so it must be non-null and likely non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.103444572Z"}
{"id":"32319e4f-3761-4c39-955d-6111614c388f","expr":"fqClassName.indexOf('.') >= -1","rationale":"Index of '.' in fqClassName is always >= -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.103444572Z"}
{"id":"bbff5893-df5f-4624-8996-09b5a0528607","expr":"fqClassName.lastIndexOf('.') <= fqClassName.length() - 1","rationale":"lastIndexOf('.') returns a valid index within string bounds or -1.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.103444572Z"}
{"id":"64d15194-cd25-4a08-a3b4-2bd920b05add","expr":"!fqClassName.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Fully qualified class names usually contain no spaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.103444572Z"}
{"id":"2a83c5f9-f4c8-4864-93b2-69e455988f21","expr":"!fqClassName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The class name should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.103444572Z"}
{"id":"30544156-45ad-400b-8a6c-8a61736425b1","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method asserts that clazz is not null at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.618241553Z"}
{"id":"dd7d683a-10e7-4fc7-8ec5-d565f27f8d46","expr":"clazz.getTypeName() != null","rationale":"A class's type name should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.618241553Z"}
{"id":"7a207c7b-e767-4f80-a980-a906500d9342","expr":"clazz.getTypeName().equals(clazz.getName()) || clazz.getTypeName().contains(\"$\")","rationale":"The type name is either equal to the name for top-level classes or contains '$' for inner classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.618241553Z"}
{"id":"82046973-99cd-4062-9842-cae1a07a3dc2","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == (clazz.getTypeName().length() <= 8)","rationale":"Primitive types have short names like int, boolean etc., so type name length is typically short for primitives.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.618241553Z"}
{"id":"1532dddd-f53b-4da7-870b-7f1ee2921374","expr":"!clazz.isArray() || clazz.getTypeName().endsWith(\"[]\")","rationale":"If the class represents an array, the type name ends with [].","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:36.618241553Z"}
{"id":"243b750d-5118-48bd-a77b-1c5f464670ce","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Result is never null because clazz.getCanonicalName() fallback to clazz.getTypeName() if null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.225555062Z"}
{"id":"ec5bbcdf-bdb2-46e4-a8b3-32510c5796bd","expr":"result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName()) || result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"By method definition, result equals either clazz.getCanonicalName() or clazz.getTypeName() depending on nullity.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.225555062Z"}
{"id":"dfeaed0e-cd1c-439d-a8b5-f18bf090d168","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || result.equals(clazz.getCanonicalName())","rationale":"If the canonicalName is non-null, result must equal canonicalName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.225555062Z"}
{"id":"df4bff30-02bf-4295-87d1-3edc48ed10de","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() != null || result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"If canonicalName is null, result must equal clazz.getTypeName().","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.225555062Z"}
{"id":"88633d1b-1530-4c04-9203-ef1893776ce9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null string either from substring or an empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.258332860Z"}
{"id":"9cd2b502-ea95-4d2d-9c4a-ffdd9faecbd5","expr":"!(result.isEmpty()) || (fqClassName.lastIndexOf('.') == -1)","rationale":"If no package separator dot in fqClassName, result is empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.258332860Z"}
{"id":"55c7fe70-5149-4d4f-ab3f-c88e3b109190","expr":"(result.isEmpty() && fqClassName.lastIndexOf('.') == -1) || (!result.isEmpty() && fqClassName.startsWith(result + \".\"))","rationale":"Result is the substring up to last dot or empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.258332860Z"}
{"id":"d23f030c-2fd3-448d-a343-790af2f18817","expr":"fqClassName.length() >= result.length()","rationale":"The length of result must not be greater than fqClassName length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.258332860Z"}
{"id":"4904a3df-25ca-43c5-a5dc-bc36be2956d5","expr":"result.equals(\"\") || fqClassName.charAt(result.length()) == '.'","rationale":"Result corresponds to the package name, so next char after result is a dot.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPackageName(String):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.258332860Z"}
{"id":"92c079cc-da3a-4556-90b5-ba501ceea739","expr":"clazz != null && result.equals(clazz.getTypeName())","rationale":"The method returns clazz.getTypeName() so result must equal clazz.getTypeName() if clazz is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.502514672Z"}
{"id":"970252d5-f181-4136-904c-d5db0fb68b0c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The getTypeName() method always returns a non-null String, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.502514672Z"}
{"id":"9fecc296-78b6-4aaa-bbb8-67ddb25f75ae","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The parameter clazz must not be null as asserted at method start.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.938553617Z"}
{"id":"d026ea78-65e6-435c-b365-d004bbf7594a","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Primitive classes typically do not have canonical names, so clazz.isPrimitive implies getCanonicalName might be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.938553617Z"}
{"id":"572ce844-e482-460b-9568-c469ec150840","expr":"clazz.getCanonicalName() == null || clazz.getCanonicalName().equals(clazz.getTypeName()) || clazz.getCanonicalName().contains(\".\")","rationale":"If canonical name is not null, it typically contains dots representing package separators.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.938553617Z"}
{"id":"6ca3d9db-aaba-4e45-8efc-08679eda1303","expr":"clazz.getTypeName() != null","rationale":"The return of getTypeName is always non-null so the fallback to getTypeName happens if getCanonicalName is null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getCanonicalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:37.938553617Z"}
{"id":"c6f25630-c52b-439a-a2ab-555d3538173e","expr":"method != null && method.getName() != null && !method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"The method parameter is likely non-null and its name is a meaningful string, reflecting a valid method object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:38.679456295Z"}
{"id":"e2aadf20-3eda-4155-94a7-d7820095ad16","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"The parameter count is always zero or more for a method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:38.679456295Z"}
{"id":"0a1eac78-b62f-455e-a059-3adb8866160e","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"The method always belongs to a declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:38.679456295Z"}
{"id":"e996c7d7-c9e9-4928-a9de-448e128319a2","expr":"!method.isSynthetic()","rationale":"Method is expected to be a user-defined or standard class method, not synthetic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:38.679456295Z"}
{"id":"f804a522-aaae-404a-b373-342675d0e29b","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must not be null, as asserted by the method precondition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.248380780Z"}
{"id":"75df99dc-c325-4ee2-b9f3-d00dd795e219","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method always has a declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.248380780Z"}
{"id":"2744c6a2-ed9c-4ffd-aeaf-8a258f4fdacb","expr":"clazz == null || clazz.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass()) == false","rationale":"No direct assignability relationship implied between clazz and method's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.248380780Z"}
{"id":"dfe23a65-94ab-4f99-bd85-f88486799e63","expr":"(clazz == null) || (clazz != null)","rationale":"Simple tautology demonstrating clazz can be null or non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.248380780Z"}
{"id":"c20294f3-3f32-4da0-a17c-271271ec1759","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"Method name is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.248380780Z"}
{"id":"1acfc492-054b-4ed5-b46b-5555b91c8542","expr":"result != null && !result.isEmpty() && method != null && method.getName() != null && result.contains(method.getName())","rationale":"The returned qualified method name string should at minimum include the simple name of the method object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.651014382Z"}
{"id":"849c23c7-c887-48f8-96d7-5e62dff80f5e","expr":"result.startsWith(method.getDeclaringClass().getName())","rationale":"The returned qualified name includes the declaring class's fully qualified name as a prefix.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.651014382Z"}
{"id":"7aea61b8-eaf8-4a20-9265-38454b3ae56c","expr":"method != null && result != null && (result.equals(method.getName()) || result.contains(\".\") )","rationale":"The result either equals the simple method name or includes it as part of a qualified name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.651014382Z"}
{"id":"3931caec-6d26-49b9-9f58-535856e3c177","expr":"result != null && method != null && method.getName() != null && result.endsWith(method.getName())","rationale":"The qualified method name string should end with the method's name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.651014382Z"}
{"id":"c88a5d33-644c-4911-8127-d8838fc39150","expr":"clazz.isInterface() == false","rationale":"An interface cannot have constructors, so if the method is applicable, clazz should not be an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.776082530Z"}
{"id":"679173df-6fb1-436b-abac-b8d551fade2c","expr":"paramTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"paramTypes must be a valid array with non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.776082530Z"}
{"id":"49b82357-c5a0-4ba5-a060-693ad0c56459","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive()","rationale":"Primitive types do not have constructors, so clazz should not represent a primitive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasConstructor(Class<?>,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:39.776082530Z"}
{"id":"b354304d-b2a9-46a2-b0ed-7b05e3adb420","expr":"result.startsWith((clazz != null ? clazz : method.getDeclaringClass()).getName())","rationale":"The method constructs result by prepending the class name followed by a dot before the method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:40.172414893Z"}
{"id":"68ba6d20-24c9-47d4-bc4e-920c8d88b750","expr":"result.endsWith(method.getName())","rationale":"The returned string is the fully qualified method name which concludes with the method's name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:40.172414893Z"}
{"id":"4c68f901-d6ab-4e4a-b686-e71269638035","expr":"result.length() > 1","rationale":"The result includes at least one character for the class name plus dot and method name, so length is greater than 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getQualifiedMethodName(Method,Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:40.172414893Z"}
{"id":"2e92b294-15c7-49a4-89be-137dc2561e3e","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method immediately asserts clazz is not null, so at entry clazz is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.196870401Z"}
{"id":"eb1a19a9-706b-4a1b-96bc-35162e84bc79","expr":"paramTypes != null","rationale":"As a varargs parameter in Java, paramTypes is never null when the method is called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.196870401Z"}
{"id":"b43f9470-038d-42f5-bfb6-b12985c649c7","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"A class is always assignable from itself, so clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz) is true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.196870401Z"}
{"id":"915e3f8d-5996-4347-a071-32b5a9f67a88","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().equals(clazz)","rationale":"The method returns a constructor from the class clazz or null if not found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getConstructorIfAvailable(Class<T>,Class<?>):Constructor<T>","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.493293997Z"}
{"id":"e884a767-ed80-4fe9-9548-336d2f70457f","expr":"clazz != null && method != null","rationale":"Both clazz and method are asserted non-null at the start of the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.912712455Z"}
{"id":"e3008a6d-57de-4356-a0f3-5df96023df12","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"A Method object always has a non-null declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.912712455Z"}
{"id":"0be72d4d-6ffd-48d3-9474-e155c03afe0f","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The name of the method is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.912712455Z"}
{"id":"7a381d7f-9e1d-4909-bb90-1fca1ae8bd1a","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"Parameter types array is never null in a valid Method object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.912712455Z"}
{"id":"7d992ac4-07dd-4fa0-b7e1-98ab713c84a6","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass()) || !clazz.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"Shows class and declaring class share a defined assignability relation (always true, but meaningful conceptually).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:41.912712455Z"}
{"id":"3aed93cd-3c75-413e-9bfd-6003bae338c2","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"methodName must not be empty to allow searching for a method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:43.518673186Z"}
{"id":"ceabdcb9-eaf3-4f82-b912-60b82d8034a9","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"A class is always assignable from itself, indicating consistent class hierarchy.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:43.518673186Z"}
{"id":"893c0590-127d-444b-b01b-91a4384cd81d","expr":"clazz.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"clazz.getDeclaredMethods() returns a non-null array of methods declared by the class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:43.518673186Z"}
{"id":"f678424c-2b6f-4006-97f2-b2c9eb2732bf","expr":"paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"paramTypes is a Class array, so its runtime type is array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:43.518673186Z"}
{"id":"ab64b030-58fb-44e5-b5a3-a0c356e0d1c7","expr":"!result || (clazz != null && methodName != null)","rationale":"If result is true, then clazz and methodName must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:43.966644645Z"}
{"id":"4e8e912a-37f7-4983-8161-a682b0e62c79","expr":"result != null","rationale":"This method either returns a valid Method object or throws an exception, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:44.348540075Z"}
{"id":"221e77ce-2d2c-44eb-9466-6452c50fc6b5","expr":"result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The method found or returned must have the name equal to the methodName parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:44.348540075Z"}
{"id":"99f178c9-7f8a-48be-bbeb-0a5f4ed57eb7","expr":"clazz.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The returned method must be declared by a class compatible with clazz.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:44.348540075Z"}
{"id":"25749af8-cf96-4fbf-ae1c-e512b297b12d","expr":"(! (paramTypes == null) ) || (result.getParameterCount() == 0)","rationale":"When paramTypes is null, the method returns the unique method by name, which should have zero parameters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:44.348540075Z"}
{"id":"48bd20d8-1fb6-439c-bb13-c51eee5a1089","expr":"(paramTypes == null) || (paramTypes.length == result.getParameterCount())","rationale":"When paramTypes is provided, the returned method matches those parameter types exactly.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:44.348540075Z"}
{"id":"cadb4af9-d63a-498f-bac9-7980daa06247","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null && (! (paramTypes == null) || paramTypes.length >= 0)","rationale":"The method asserts clazz and methodName are not null, and paramTypes can be null or an array of any length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.034018710Z"}
{"id":"0fba7057-41a9-4749-9620-f4e9ff771512","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"For a method to exist by that name, the methodName should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.034018710Z"}
{"id":"54df5761-5b8d-44ec-a2c4-1cc34629860e","expr":"paramTypes == null || paramTypes.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"paramTypes should be either null or an array of Class<?>.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.034018710Z"}
{"id":"9045a2a5-f659-4afa-aaa2-4203fbdd04d7","expr":"paramTypes == null || (paramTypes != null && clazz.getMethods() != null)","rationale":"If paramTypes is provided, then clazz must have methods (since getMethod is called).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.034018710Z"}
{"id":"f1e15951-6dde-4987-880e-34df6ce53722","expr":"clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"clazz.getName() is used in error messages, so non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.034018710Z"}
{"id":"153d3278-55f2-40ac-b0e0-a2234a7577e4","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"If a Method is returned, its name must match the requested methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.497467736Z"}
{"id":"8bc60fb0-143b-4557-98fe-51ce7a2e2e85","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"The returned method, if present, should be declared by clazz or assignable from it.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.497467736Z"}
{"id":"9b4e84fc-5778-459a-9beb-227e371c0ae9","expr":"(paramTypes != null) || (result == null || result.getParameterCount() >= 0)","rationale":"If paramTypes are null and a method is returned, it must have some valid parameter count.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.497467736Z"}
{"id":"0af2230a-a91a-4236-b143-12670e1a1fe1","expr":"paramTypes != null || result == null || result.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"If paramTypes is null and result is not null, result's parameter type array is valid.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.497467736Z"}
{"id":"7465ae8d-47e2-4f8c-b98f-2a9b70666f26","expr":"(paramTypes != null) || (!paramTypes != null && (result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)))","rationale":"When paramTypes is null, any returned method matches the methodName (candidate) found.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.497467736Z"}
{"id":"d0f4ba79-a98d-4e54-b6fb-ade7f58e14a6","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Checking method availability generally applies to non-primitive classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.543933993Z"}
{"id":"e37bcfce-1afe-457a-a148-c3eafaed842e","expr":"methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"It's reasonable to expect methodName to be a non-empty string at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.543933993Z"}
{"id":"1b88dd0f-932b-4bd6-aff5-f7c0e2e1c378","expr":"paramTypes == null || paramTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"By definition, array length is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodIfAvailable(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.543933993Z"}
{"id":"0427b261-e357-415c-8dd1-956fb430ad55","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null","rationale":"Method asserts non-nullness of its parameters at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.995264564Z"}
{"id":"eab2a0b5-8782-41d8-ace3-613499191ca2","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"Method names are usually non-empty strings.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.995264564Z"}
{"id":"1faf2bf0-0504-4a44-b426-170551f369c9","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"Java API guarantees getInterfaces() returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.995264564Z"}
{"id":"0a6b1be8-ba84-4af0-9955-9a49d77931dc","expr":"clazz.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"Java API guarantees getDeclaredMethods() returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:45.995264564Z"}
{"id":"a71e2c95-9aa9-49ea-8007-daba00b35fe0","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"The method counts matching methods, so the result must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.195155504Z"}
{"id":"f495f3cb-66fa-4f41-a3c7-cf61b75be111","expr":"!methodName.isEmpty() || result == 0","rationale":"If methodName is empty, there are no matching methods, so result must be zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.195155504Z"}
{"id":"1e08fa09-746d-44e4-8582-2fc051b67dda","expr":"result <= clazz.getDeclaredMethods().length + (clazz.getInterfaces().length * result) + (clazz.getSuperclass() != null ? result : 0)","rationale":"The count is at most the sum of methods declared in clazz and those counted recursively in interfaces and superclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMethodCountForName(Class<?>,String):int","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.195155504Z"}
{"id":"58fd0a29-ca0f-4709-88b7-26dc76f35333","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null","rationale":"The method asserts that both clazz and methodName must not be null at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.246034564Z"}
{"id":"c9820953-d3a2-4a74-8775-b6a0da38c064","expr":"clazz.getDeclaredMethods() != null","rationale":"The getDeclaredMethods() method returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.246034564Z"}
{"id":"1904d436-4155-4a1e-8c12-642b8696beb4","expr":"methodName.length() >= 0","rationale":"methodName is a String and length() returns a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.246034564Z"}
{"id":"da664fad-5c21-4a74-889a-33fc1ee0a379","expr":"clazz.getInterfaces() != null","rationale":"The getInterfaces() method returns a non-null array of interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.246034564Z"}
{"id":"deedf249-5afb-4dae-8528-7adab0a09960","expr":"clazz.getSuperclass() != clazz","rationale":"A class's superclass is never the class itself.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:47.246034564Z"}
{"id":"5b0de479-77b9-4f74-b553-1a2ff3554746","expr":"!result || clazz.getMethods().length > 0","rationale":"If there is at least one method with the given name, clazz must have at least one method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.330491439Z"}
{"id":"a5c806b7-9de8-405f-b428-c0fd05f82ce3","expr":"!result || methodName != null && methodName.length() > 0","rationale":"If a method with the name exists, methodName must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.330491439Z"}
{"id":"eecd0f15-1ec2-4615-b069-7831af7d4347","expr":"result == (clazz != null && methodName != null)","rationale":"If result is true, inputs must be non-null as asserted by method preconditions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.330491439Z"}
{"id":"6a287732-ca71-4630-8450-141cfdee7c8d","expr":"!result || clazz.getName() != null","rationale":"If a method is found, clazz itself should be a valid Class object with a name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#hasAtLeastOneMethodWithName(Class<?>,String):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.330491439Z"}
{"id":"7a12809c-f3ef-4c8d-b184-45ea9c891c3a","expr":"method != null && method.getDeclaringClass() != null && targetClass != null && (targetClass != method.getDeclaringClass()) == true || targetClass == null","rationale":"From the first 'if' condition, we know that if targetClass is not null, targetClass != method.getDeclaringClass() or targetClass == null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.947539180Z"}
{"id":"49c394af-790e-4e0d-8e86-9b85de1a15bd","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(targetClass) == true || !method.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(targetClass)","rationale":"From the condition in the if, it checks isAssignableFrom and negates it, so this boolean relationship must hold.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.947539180Z"}
{"id":"93db434c-ce0c-46c9-ab53-3bda50272d64","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"For safe code, method.getName() cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.947539180Z"}
{"id":"a22e9548-d281-4314-aa8f-b7ba4e4d0ccd","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The method parameter types are used in reflection calls and cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:48.947539180Z"}
{"id":"4cdd1630-29d9-472c-844a-85c760a87591","expr":"method != null && method.getDeclaringClass() != null && method.getName() != null && method.getParameterCount() >= 0 && method.getReturnType() != null && method.isAccessible() == false","rationale":"Method is expected to be a valid JDK Method instance with non-null declaring class, name, return type, and non-negative parameter count as this is the entry point of getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.226838738Z"}
{"id":"4bdd770e-797b-4019-a160-b6fc7b2ab60e","expr":"method.isSynthetic() == false","rationale":"Since the method is for interface method querying, synthetic methods are unlikely to be targeted, so method.isSynthetic() should be false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.226838738Z"}
{"id":"1ce5d016-ab62-48ac-b326-c0122af8af58","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass().isInterface() == false || method.getDeclaringClass().getInterfaces().length >= 0","rationale":"If declaring class is interface, it has no further interfaces, else it may implement several interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.226838738Z"}
{"id":"98feae31-175a-47a7-9942-241590712c7b","expr":"method.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Method names must be a non-empty string as per JDK Method contract.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.226838738Z"}
{"id":"5b05408b-1ec4-4b22-a8bb-68de7c774f94","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Parameter count can never be negative for a valid Method instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.226838738Z"}
{"id":"ac73c928-60a2-4961-8841-97b261b93c58","expr":"method != null && targetClass != null && method.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(targetClass)","rationale":"The method likely belongs to or is compatible with the target class or its interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.882075746Z"}
{"id":"bec6bea1-ebb4-405b-8992-71df4f9ce32e","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"getParameterCount always returns non-negative number.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.882075746Z"}
{"id":"e4f9228d-ab0f-49a2-9da7-f31085a173e5","expr":"!method.isSynthetic()","rationale":"Methods passed here are generally user-declared, not synthetic.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.882075746Z"}
{"id":"4492167d-18ad-4b25-b6b1-b1c093501f74","expr":"targetClass == null || method.getDeclaringClass().isInterface() || targetClass.isInterface()","rationale":"It makes sense if either the method's declaring class or targetClass is interface when targetClass is specified.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.882075746Z"}
{"id":"ea496531-a6b9-4222-8a5c-93b3ba6e27db","expr":"targetClass == null || method.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(targetClass)","rationale":"Ensures the target class is assignable from method's declaring class or targetClass is null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:49.882075746Z"}
{"id":"11bbb35a-3d1b-4123-8140-c4fd71141be6","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isInterface() || result.equals(method)","rationale":"If result is not null, it is an interface method or the original method, based on the method's purpose.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:50.102183306Z"}
{"id":"6a67bb7f-f5fd-4974-aee3-46c9c51bbb4a","expr":"result == null || method.isPublic() && result.isPublic()","rationale":"If result is not null, its visibility generally matches the original method's visibility.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:50.102183306Z"}
{"id":"86418794-666e-4806-a4b7-e969bd39399f","expr":"result == null || method.getName().equals(result.getName())","rationale":"The method name should be preserved if an interface method is returned.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:50.102183306Z"}
{"id":"c5a2a782-bdc2-4fe1-9966-6f262377cbd2","expr":"result == null || result.getParameterCount() == method.getParameterCount()","rationale":"Returned interface method matches the parameter count of input method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:50.102183306Z"}
{"id":"606c80d6-59a9-4aca-a384-6db120cdcbf1","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"Ensures that the result method has a valid declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.002349126Z"}
{"id":"1699a7ef-327b-47f3-bb7f-13d5d8ce52bf","expr":"result.isAccessible() == method.isAccessible()","rationale":"The accessibility of the 'result' method matches that of 'method'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.002349126Z"}
{"id":"1df7478a-e926-490f-b3ed-61490411df02","expr":"(targetClass == null) || (result.getDeclaringClass() == method.getDeclaringClass() || targetClass.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass()))","rationale":"Ensures that the result method's declaring class is compatible with the targetClass if one is specified.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.002349126Z"}
{"id":"80240211-c304-4552-8666-219731cefc27","expr":"result.getParameterCount() == method.getParameterCount()","rationale":"Ensures the number of parameters of the result and the input method are the same.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getMostSpecificMethod(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.002349126Z"}
{"id":"5a8c5a4b-3df0-4846-aa14-e420f80b6448","expr":"method != null && targetClass != null || targetClass == null","rationale":"targetClass may be null or non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.881792665Z"}
{"id":"231b3b4a-db96-47cb-9ad8-80dc91c83d83","expr":"method.getName() != null","rationale":"The method's name is not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.881792665Z"}
{"id":"1bb213ca-a91c-470d-b712-cb4b4dd6c91c","expr":"method.getParameterTypes() != null","rationale":"The method's parameter types array is not null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:51.881792665Z"}
{"id":"cd4538ec-a096-48cd-a351-b0d70f084e56","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method only returns 'null' from caches or searches, but if null, it returns 'method', so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.171646280Z"}
{"id":"aadbf34d-4029-4705-ab19-58bb1da53f5c","expr":"result.getName().equals(method.getName())","rationale":"The method always returns a method with the same name as the parameter method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.171646280Z"}
{"id":"080a6d07-50d3-49e2-9657-25a858e3e3b4","expr":"(requirePublicInterface && result.getDeclaringClass().isInterface()) || !requirePublicInterface","rationale":"The method finds an interface method only if requirePublicInterface implies public interface method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.171646280Z"}
{"id":"acacf42d-f0f9-4f3f-a033-653d35ce9b44","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass().isInterface() || result.equals(method)","rationale":"The method returns a method declared in an interface if available, else returns the input method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.171646280Z"}
{"id":"5c634c3a-a788-421c-93f9-beb2800f6dad","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"The method returns a Method object whose name matches the methodName parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findInterfaceMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.384134552Z"}
{"id":"56c05fe4-2686-4188-b382-aa3d0957016b","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isInterface()","rationale":"The result Method, if not null, is declared by an interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findInterfaceMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.384134552Z"}
{"id":"1f48901c-8c24-42c3-a3b7-0bb815a51737","expr":"startClass.isAssignableFrom(endClass) || !startClass.isAssignableFrom(endClass)","rationale":"No restriction exists on startClass and endClass relationship; they may be unrelated but are Class objects.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findInterfaceMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.703212007Z"}
{"id":"9fc4c105-a8df-4eb6-8b70-7ff1e1826677","expr":"startClass != endClass || startClass == endClass","rationale":"Represents the general relationship between startClass and endClass; no restriction implied.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findInterfaceMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.703212007Z"}
{"id":"139eee74-1d86-48a2-a03e-d0cc3c101581","expr":"methodName.length() > 0 || methodName.length() == 0","rationale":"No restriction on methodName's string content; may be empty or non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findInterfaceMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>,Class<?>,boolean):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:53.703212007Z"}
{"id":"84f27a37-280b-4aec-88a2-f84e2bc57eb3","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a Method either directly or from the cache, so result is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:54.528647216Z"}
{"id":"72807d2f-f08f-426b-9846-5130d81d203f","expr":"result.getName().equals(method.getName())","rationale":"The search for a publicly accessible method maintains the same method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:54.528647216Z"}
{"id":"adfaee58-6072-406e-8569-724b6af5c542","expr":"method != null && targetClass == null || targetClass != null","rationale":"method is expected to be non-null at method entry; targetClass may or may not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.018209965Z"}
{"id":"8a3e6d77-73d9-46dc-8728-97baab4aec1b","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"According to Java reflection API, getDeclaringClass() returns non-null for a valid Method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.018209965Z"}
{"id":"4e245afe-586a-4090-80ac-0cb188484eeb","expr":"(targetClass == null || targetClass.isAssignableFrom(method.getDeclaringClass()) || true)","rationale":"targetClass may be null; if non-null, isAssignableFrom can be called safely.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.018209965Z"}
{"id":"33cf402e-6810-41bc-b2af-bb6d7de825d9","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass().getModule() != null","rationale":"Java 9+ reflection API guarantees getModule() returns non-null Module.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.018209965Z"}
{"id":"f9eb2a2f-f737-435a-8b01-e32d0d329ba2","expr":"(targetClass == null || !targetClass.isInterface()) || (result != null && result.getDeclaringClass() != null && targetClass.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass()))","rationale":"Ensures the returned method's declaring class is assignable to targetClass if targetClass is a non-null interface.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.283080806Z"}
{"id":"58279c20-d8c4-4027-8372-b1d5820a8ad6","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(method.getName())","rationale":"The returned method, if non-null, has the same name as the input method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.283080806Z"}
{"id":"8e745af2-2f99-4d78-95a1-05bb07a2ddb4","expr":"result == null || result.getReturnType().equals(method.getReturnType())","rationale":"The returned method, if non-null, has the same return type as the input method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getInterfaceMethodIfPossible(Method,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:55.283080806Z"}
{"id":"2baab10e-5fe0-4569-a066-54691eae8461","expr":"method != null","rationale":"The method parameter must not be null at method entry as per the assert statement.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isUserLevelMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:56.703887052Z"}
{"id":"91947103-bef9-4b27-84ac-1fb610b68d85","expr":"!method.isSynthetic() || method.isBridge()","rationale":"If the method is synthetic, it must be bridge to be considered user level; reflects implication in the code.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isUserLevelMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:56.703887052Z"}
{"id":"cb49b117-6796-4cf5-9653-4f7244e0a7ba","expr":"!method.isSynthetic() || result || method.isBridge()","rationale":"Reflects the logical structure of the return condition involving isSynthetic, isBridge, and result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isUserLevelMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:57.846471174Z"}
{"id":"b5f9ab81-b274-4e61-9460-30ed4b9940ac","expr":"result == false || method.isBridge() || !method.isSynthetic()","rationale":"Captures that result being true means some conditions on method hold true.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isUserLevelMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:57.846471174Z"}
{"id":"481be335-35be-4279-aa6a-88647a70b5e7","expr":"result == null || result.getName().equals(methodName)","rationale":"Consistency that returned method's name equals the requested methodName.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:58.165196454Z"}
{"id":"21ee42eb-02d2-4eb2-aa20-c66618361b1d","expr":"result == null || result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(declaringClass) || declaringClass.isAssignableFrom(result.getDeclaringClass())","rationale":"The returned method comes from a superclass or the class itself related to declaringClass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:58.165196454Z"}
{"id":"56bf0d85-9562-4f8b-b8eb-d3bbe0c25e43","expr":"methodName != null && !methodName.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name parameter should be a valid identifier string for finding the method.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:59.283471561Z"}
{"id":"579d2368-3cdb-46e3-aa07-7da38fa6260a","expr":"parameterTypes != null","rationale":"The parameter types array is expected to be provided for method signature matching.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:59.283471561Z"}
{"id":"afd474f9-a581-470d-98d8-4c19169d8883","expr":"declaringClass != null","rationale":"To find a method, the declaring class reference must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:59.283471561Z"}
{"id":"cd53c885-fc00-4181-b706-6339664de0ea","expr":"parameterTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Arrays in Java have non-negative lengths, so parameterTypes.length is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:59.283471561Z"}
{"id":"cfadff1a-541a-42f7-8579-25b7e43692aa","expr":"!declaringClass.isInterface()","rationale":"Method searches and superclass lookups are on classes, not interfaces.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#findPubliclyAccessibleMethodIfPossible(String,Class<?>[],Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:59.283471561Z"}
{"id":"98cbbd2d-d985-4d4c-b6ba-880993ded443","expr":"method != null && method.getDeclaringClass() != null && method.getDeclaringClass().getName() != null","rationale":"The method and its class name must be non-null to safely call equals in implementation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isGroovyObjectMethod(Method):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:43:59.332577443Z"}
{"id":"8f18144c-9931-4965-a576-18999e1f323d","expr":"targetClass == null || method.getDeclaringClass().getPackageName().equals(targetClass.getPackageName())","rationale":"Either targetClass is null or it has the same package name as method's declaring class.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#isOverridable(Method,Class<?>):boolean","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:44:00.315598967Z"}
{"id":"87bca809-1e59-40f5-ab87-19c7393332c4","expr":"clazz != null && methodName != null && args != null && args.getClass().isArray() && clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz)","rationale":"From the Assert statements in the method, clazz and methodName are not null. Args is a Class<?>... (varargs), so it is non-null and an array of Class<?>. clazz.isAssignableFrom(clazz) is true as any class is assignable from itself, reflecting a basic class relationship.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.util.ClassUtils#getStaticMethod(Class<?>,String,Class<?>):Method","file":"org/springframework/util/ClassUtils.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T00:44:00.717984531Z"}
