{"id":"a917bc11-522e-41cf-8b33-7c21bf085a77","expr":"interfaces != null && interfaces.length >= 0","rationale":"The interfaces array is never null after begin_class, as it is either passed directly or combined with delegateIf.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AddDelegateTransformer#begin_class(int,int,String,Type,Type[],String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AddDelegateTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:44.959596505Z"}
