{"id":"1b4e1dbb-a3ce-456b-b125-39afe639556a","expr":"result == newValue","rationale":"Since the method returns newValue, result must be equal to newValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeBoolean(Object,String,boolean,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:50.073670641Z"}
{"id":"6f9015b9-b8f1-4347-a664-5b0c0d1e9ef2","expr":"result != oldValue","rationale":"Because result equals newValue, and oldValue can be different, result is not necessarily equal to oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeBoolean(Object,String,boolean,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:50.073670641Z"}
