{"id":"ecee60f6-b887-453a-a197-4eed357278d7","expr":"result == newValue && oldValue != result","rationale":"result equals newValue and possibly differs from oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeDouble(Object,String,double,double):double","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:52.166651519Z"}
{"id":"6594e5d4-e53d-454c-a5c3-e6c9e7515380","expr":"result == newValue","rationale":"The method returns newValue, so result must be equal to newValue","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeObject(Object,String,Object,Object):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:52.318337047Z"}
{"id":"2390fb13-2b88-446a-b150-6a68b57abf12","expr":"result == newValue","rationale":"The method returns newValue directly, so the result must be equal to newValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeFloat(Object,String,float,float):float","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:52.335396313Z"}
{"id":"d9a0b41d-044e-4e95-9a3b-3920a71d0cf6","expr":"result != oldValue || newValue == oldValue","rationale":"Since result equals newValue, result differs from oldValue unless newValue equals oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeFloat(Object,String,float,float):float","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:52.335396313Z"}
{"id":"153d8df8-9cec-467f-8c38-d39404c21585","expr":"result == newValue","rationale":"The method returns newValue directly, so result equals newValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeLong(Object,String,long,long):long","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:52.614547541Z"}
{"id":"dbbc5f1f-17e7-427e-aa18-d0fc2899d32a","expr":"result != oldValue","rationale":"As the method returns newValue, typically the result differs from oldValue except when newValue equals oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#writeLong(Object,String,long,long):long","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:52.614547541Z"}
