{"id":"b5f58b2b-ad0b-4883-8dce-c78fb2ab458f","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method returns oldValue, so result must equal oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readChar(Object,String,char):char","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:53.301551614Z"}
{"id":"de5a6356-26d6-489c-9637-2ea9625f0fbf","expr":"obj != null || name != null || true","rationale":"Since obj and name are parameters, they might be null or non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readChar(Object,String,char):char","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:53.941450902Z"}
