{"id":"219ca8f2-eda6-4fb8-843f-fbce11118f55","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Assuming 'name' is a field name, it should be a non-null and non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readInt(Object,String,int):int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:54.073220210Z"}
{"id":"6964bb4a-a8fb-40f3-b6fb-08e9631e020b","expr":"obj != null","rationale":"The 'obj' parameter should not be null in the method context.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readInt(Object,String,int):int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:54.073220210Z"}
{"id":"3df98f44-a5ad-4ce0-a043-5c1f8eda54da","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method implementation returns oldValue, so result must be equal to oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readBoolean(Object,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:54.145701997Z"}
{"id":"d6d5ea4d-35e6-4ed4-9bfc-ecb968fc8d05","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The parameter 'name' is typically expected to be a non-null String representing a field name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readByte(Object,String,byte):byte","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:54.538705188Z"}
{"id":"d296a84d-31cb-46cb-9b61-bbc4f8b5c3b5","expr":"obj != null || name != null","rationale":"It is plausible that either the target object or the field name should be non-null to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readByte(Object,String,byte):byte","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:54.538705188Z"}
{"id":"e01432ef-7527-495f-9daa-001e07735260","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method implementation returns 'oldValue' directly as the result.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readShort(Object,String,short):short","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:54.919519371Z"}
{"id":"b133bb62-3139-4c12-9a6f-83a5ddbace78","expr":"name != null || obj == null || oldValue == false","rationale":"Since oldValue is a boolean, it is either true or false, no further simple invariants.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readBoolean(Object,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.071065887Z"}
{"id":"6925fb0c-5f9c-4fed-99e3-a92e45fda083","expr":"obj == null || name != null","rationale":"Logical assumption that field name should be non-null when object is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readBoolean(Object,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.071065887Z"}
{"id":"f8ecac12-38cb-4c36-9de4-a912745d76d5","expr":"oldValue == true || oldValue == false","rationale":"oldValue is a primitive boolean variable.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readBoolean(Object,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.071065887Z"}
{"id":"adf87317-9217-402f-98a5-6ea6603f74cd","expr":"(name != null) || (oldValue == false) || (obj == null)","rationale":"A weak invariant reflecting safety checks on name and object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readBoolean(Object,String,boolean):boolean","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.071065887Z"}
{"id":"452d4b76-0154-46a3-a65b-b55fefd9c66d","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method implementation returns oldValue without modification, so result equals oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readFloat(Object,String,float):float","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.143732513Z"}
{"id":"ca1f97ce-b1ff-48c1-9203-4a8c1efa27c1","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, a field name parameter should be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readShort(Object,String,short):short","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.654997083Z"}
{"id":"4919a5cb-0eb5-4969-b92f-f8ad591ec070","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method entry, the field name string is usually non-null and non-empty to identify a field.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readFloat(Object,String,float):float","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.693826450Z"}
{"id":"462a0285-8e27-4e2f-98d4-ad0c2b44892e","expr":"obj != null","rationale":"The target object should be non-null for the field read operation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readFloat(Object,String,float):float","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.693826450Z"}
{"id":"bd571a83-1bb7-467e-8e46-6092727b1a42","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method simply returns oldValue without modification.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readDouble(Object,String,double):double","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:55.926037024Z"}
{"id":"5774e6ac-6c6d-486e-a663-41cc38ad2ba9","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method directly returns oldValue, so result equals oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readLong(Object,String,long):long","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:56.163915512Z"}
{"id":"bae46770-e9fb-486c-a585-39f75004ab15","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, the field name to read would be a valid identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readDouble(Object,String,double):double","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:56.452139134Z"}
{"id":"afdc559a-5e2d-479d-a8e1-632ae855b96c","expr":"Double.isFinite(oldValue)","rationale":"Assuming the previous value is a valid finite double value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readDouble(Object,String,double):double","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:56.452139134Z"}
{"id":"b9154606-597c-4fa0-bcc5-1e7f53211023","expr":"obj != null","rationale":"Read operations generally assume a non-null target object.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readDouble(Object,String,double):double","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:56.452139134Z"}
{"id":"c69ecb9d-65d7-49c0-a94b-0d995c2d674d","expr":"result == oldValue","rationale":"The method returns oldValue directly, so result is equal to oldValue.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readObject(Object,String,Object):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:56.839978944Z"}
{"id":"71c7796e-2271-42d8-969c-40b1090ee297","expr":"obj != null || obj == null","rationale":"No restrictions on obj being null or not at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.impl.AbstractInterceptFieldCallback#readLong(Object,String,long):long","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/impl/AbstractInterceptFieldCallback.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:27:56.883929722Z"}
