{"id":"37c27949-8cad-47f0-84bb-74bf19b08deb","expr":"signature == null || (signature != null && !signature.isEmpty())","rationale":"Signature can be null or a non-empty string, ensuring if non-null it is meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:43.270077211Z"}
{"id":"aefd10bd-a755-431a-9cb2-4764a01d9c36","expr":"(access & 0x1) == 0 || (access & 0x1) == 1","rationale":"Access flags are integers that may have bitflags set; lowest bit check is a simple invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.AbstractClassFilterTransformer#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/AbstractClassFilterTransformer.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:43.270077211Z"}
