{"id":"f2b43177-ac0b-43a7-8a6a-43389d6f5253","expr":"v != null && v.getClass() != null","rationale":"v is not null and represents a concrete ClassVisitor object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#setTarget(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:48.138059067Z"}
{"id":"1cc522a8-d056-42d4-acc2-888988362a24","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns cv.visitMethod, which typically returns a valid MethodVisitor, result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:48.438612573Z"}
