{"id":"f980d995-aa77-4f4e-ac5d-e14fdcd06b7e","expr":"desc != null && !desc.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor is expected to represent the method signature and thus not be empty or null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:48.881310138Z"}
{"id":"d8d66577-5a37-4bad-93a0-24c1f7c29844","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Either no exceptions or some exceptions declared.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:48.881310138Z"}
{"id":"d02696a9-4b31-4e54-84e5-972e48079e5e","expr":"signature == null || !signature.isEmpty()","rationale":"Signature is optional but when present not empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.ClassTransformerChain#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/ClassTransformerChain.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:48.881310138Z"}
{"id":"565c06e7-a4cf-4f0a-bf48-1777912c8454","expr":"v != null","rationale":"The method sets v as a target in t, implying v must not be null at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.TransformingClassGenerator#generateClass(ClassVisitor):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/TransformingClassGenerator.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:49.056008695Z"}
