{"id":"a8a3543f-f3c0-41b1-8301-f3399470b62a","expr":"type >= 0 && type <= 3","rationale":"The integer 'type' corresponds to a frame type defined in ASM, hence limited to a known range 0..3.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitFrame(int,int,Object[],int,Object[]):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:28:51.971161321Z"}
