{"id":"aa452325-ac47-4fbb-9839-0c9e63c9388f","expr":"start != end","rationale":"The try-catch block should have a valid range so start and end labels are different.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:12.571666985Z"}
{"id":"3f6c032f-f2cc-4ab1-a46f-1603a2826dd9","expr":"type == null || type.length() > 0","rationale":"If type is non-null, it represents the caught exception class name, which should not be empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchBlock(Label,Label,Label,String):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:12.571666985Z"}
{"id":"4b27d5e7-af9a-48a1-beff-46962fe3bdbd","expr":"start != null","rationale":"The method calls start usage, so start should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitLineNumber(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:12.750324517Z"}
