{"id":"22274fa0-7669-4063-a4fb-7c39fb0d127e","expr":"maxStack >= 0","rationale":"maxStack represents a JVM stack size, typically non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitMaxs(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:13.938049669Z"}
