{"id":"6362b864-fe0e-454f-a488-feb10cf4e663","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"Boolean variable visible naturally can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:17.982391606Z"}
{"id":"582f5895-8cd5-4d77-a5b9-8d097b7f541b","expr":"typePath == null || typePath.getClass() != null","rationale":"typePath parameter may be null or a valid TypePath instance.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:17.982391606Z"}
{"id":"080e8481-343a-4041-a3af-bd9d0a1c2696","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns an AnnotationVisitor instance that combines the two visitors; thus, result should be a valid AnnotationVisitor object, hence non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:18.442325611Z"}
