{"id":"ebb81856-2706-4138-827f-3235c32dbdc9","expr":"name.equals(name) && desc.equals(desc)","rationale":"Ensuring name and desc are non-null strings and equal to themselves, confirming identity without null issues.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:20.037202122Z"}
