{"id":"f45ea1ba-f4ef-4431-8271-f5fff6f20bda","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"Boolean parameter can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:20.728264979Z"}
{"id":"a1a208a2-b9b1-4e4c-9996-02c8fb5093b6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor is constructed by combining two non-null AnnotationVisitors, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:21.719020787Z"}
