{"id":"3185ef65-8631-4f3c-a57e-b7740af45056","expr":"(desc == null) || (desc.length() >= 0)","rationale":"If desc is not null, its length is at least zero","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.transform.MethodVisitorTee#visitTryCatchAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/cglib/transform/MethodVisitorTee.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:29:23.311508696Z"}
