{"id":"24306778-d841-40b0-8564-1be6d9fc8c9d","expr":"c2.getSuperclass() != null","rationale":"c2.getSuperclass() is expected to be non-null for the isAssignableFrom check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#create(Class,Class,String,String,String):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:33.353188532Z"}
{"id":"0a41448f-b1ee-4c0d-b8a0-5794a2ea6576","expr":"type != null","rationale":"The 'type' parameter is passed to g.setType(type) and g.setContextClass(type), implying that 'type' must not be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:34.407265986Z"}
{"id":"52e8e520-9b6f-4c93-bfda-ad47ff5af6d9","expr":"ci != null","rationale":"The parameter ci is used to access fields like ci.c2, ci.namingPolicy, etc. Thus, ci must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:34.407265986Z"}
{"id":"b01fe94a-41bd-4a68-9c1b-4aeb90cb066e","expr":"ci.c2 != null","rationale":"To safely call ci.c2.getClassLoader(), ci.c2 must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:34.407265986Z"}
{"id":"4189830b-da7c-4bda-905c-7d73ad91f7a5","expr":"ci.namingPolicy != null","rationale":"The method calls g.setNamingPolicy(ci.namingPolicy); implying ci.namingPolicy is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:34.407265986Z"}
{"id":"78c01bf4-b031-43e6-b9b3-5238e605bc21","expr":"ci.strategy != null","rationale":"The method calls g.setStrategy(ci.strategy); implying ci.strategy is expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:34.407265986Z"}
{"id":"45c75009-b0ba-4f51-a4c8-1d93145d2e39","expr":"owner != null && name != null && type != null && !name.isEmpty() && owner.isObject() && type.isObject() && owner.equals(type)","rationale":"All in-scope variables are non-null at method exit, and owner equals type and both represent object types; name is not empty","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.core.CodeEmitter#getstatic(Type,String,Type):void","file":"org/springframework/cglib/core/CodeEmitter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:34.409366092Z"}
{"id":"9f1e8c53-11c7-4421-8279-cff960a1d0c8","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The helper method constructs a FastClass via the generator and returns it, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:35.121820608Z"}
{"id":"c9201779-c6ea-4264-b412-6758dba54752","expr":"result.getJavaClass() == type","rationale":"FastClass represents the given type passed into the generator, so its getJavaClass() must equal type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:35.121820608Z"}
{"id":"c0b486ad-19ac-4910-b521-cdf964f39c3e","expr":"ci.c2.getClassLoader() == result.getClassLoader()","rationale":"The generator sets the class loader to ci.c2.getClassLoader(); thus the result's class loader should be the same.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#helper(CreateInfo,Class):FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:35.121820608Z"}
{"id":"dc2a80e4-4873-41cc-abd3-b75a91755e8b","expr":"result != null && result.length() > 0","rationale":"Method returns the name of a signature which should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#getSuperName():String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:35.227151718Z"}
{"id":"60895d27-8c63-42dc-89db-4bf001cf23f3","expr":"!result.contains(\" \")","rationale":"Names returned as method names typically do not have spaces.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#getSuperName():String","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:35.227151718Z"}
{"id":"4cc10cc5-8ed4-4c4a-9428-418c60f7016f","expr":"result >= 0","rationale":"The super index is likely a non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#getSuperIndex():int","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:35.496726920Z"}
{"id":"70931148-d095-46f8-83d8-a21dc504f0eb","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method initializes and returns fastClassInfo.f1, result should not be null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#getFastClass():FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:36.419473506Z"}
{"id":"c270e2c0-abdd-40ea-90e7-8f41fcaec4ad","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned FastClass object is not null after successful initialization.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#getSuperFastClass():FastClass","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:37.117690586Z"}
{"id":"41cf50e8-bb4b-4e39-82a6-365d9df5c073","expr":"type != null && sig != null && !sig.toString().isEmpty()","rationale":"It is expected that the parameters type and sig are non-null and that sig represents some meaningful method signature string for the find method to proceed.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#find(Class,Signature):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:38.715981716Z"}
{"id":"424482ac-032a-4eb7-ab06-e04908e98ff0","expr":"args != null && obj != null && result != null","rationale":"The method calls f1.invoke likely returning a non-null result for given non-null obj and args.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.065593572Z"}
{"id":"8bcf0531-cd9b-42fb-90ff-eb1f075e2470","expr":"result != args","rationale":"Typically method return is distinct from the passed argument array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.065593572Z"}
{"id":"884862cb-07a0-4be7-94c8-6efc51ff2486","expr":"result != null || result == null","rationale":"General invariant since result can be any Object, possibly null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invokeSuper(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.145532800Z"}
{"id":"254b5f2b-8ad6-4425-b934-0dafa06c0b0a","expr":"result == null || result.getClass() != null","rationale":"If result is not null, then its class is defined.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invokeSuper(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.145532800Z"}
{"id":"e12a008b-6e93-425d-906e-00323a6b466f","expr":"obj != null || (obj == null && args.length >= 0)","rationale":"obj can be null for static method proxies; args non-null as method parameter","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.301154340Z"}
{"id":"03c564d7-6547-4455-9284-b90c6535d386","expr":"args.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"args parameter is of type Object[] so getClass().isArray() is true","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.301154340Z"}
{"id":"9b428851-487c-47c3-9ad6-22a4ae2fb8a9","expr":"obj == null || obj.getClass() != null","rationale":"if obj non-null its class must be defined","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.301154340Z"}
{"id":"3113ef91-057e-47db-9b88-93db3f0e6a60","expr":"args.length >= 0","rationale":"ensures safe use of args array length","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#invoke(Object,Object[]):Object","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.301154340Z"}
{"id":"8c3aed4b-6ecd-458e-9c2a-ad4857619818","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a MethodProxy and does not allow null as a valid return value on success.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#find(Class,Signature):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.585394275Z"}
{"id":"f9b97dec-2b0c-4b30-a04d-88dbc804c207","expr":"result.getSignature().equals(sig)","rationale":"The returned MethodProxy corresponds to the input Signature 'sig', so their signatures should be equal.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#find(Class,Signature):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.585394275Z"}
{"id":"57d04c38-bbe8-480c-8489-d7d63e8374f7","expr":"result.getDeclaringClass().isAssignableFrom(type)","rationale":"The MethodProxy's declaring class should be compatible with 'type' or its subclass.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.MethodProxy#find(Class,Signature):MethodProxy","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/MethodProxy.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:39.585394275Z"}
{"id":"e1bdebcb-1622-4fae-9fb3-64580b69911a","expr":"callbackTypes != null && result != null && result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method processes the input callbackTypes array and returns a Type array corresponding to each Class, so their lengths should match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:40.570253807Z"}
{"id":"1075a38a-8874-4e8b-a90a-2872e4a9684e","expr":"callbackTypes == null || callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"An array's length property is never negative if the array is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:41.095976574Z"}
{"id":"35cf2ff0-3fec-47b5-8157-edbfc25a3591","expr":"callbackTypes == null || callbackTypes.length == 0 || callbackTypes[0] != null","rationale":"The first element of callbackTypes is non-null if the array has any elements, consistent with expected use of Class arrays.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:41.095976574Z"}
{"id":"4a2d40f5-4923-4264-bf3b-6f0f2258d04d","expr":"callbackTypes != null && callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"callbackTypes array is expected to be non-null with a non-negative length as it is used to instantiate another array of the same length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:41.671872550Z"}
{"id":"8427f3b9-5997-4000-850c-0d7af2391034","expr":"!checkAll || callbackTypes.length > 0","rationale":"If checkAll is true, callbackTypes is likely non-empty to have something to check.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:41.671872550Z"}
{"id":"5983e938-8915-4c4a-8bb8-8265c57e9dcd","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length can never be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:41.671872550Z"}
{"id":"af7ea5f3-b78f-47fa-bd33-4686ed4fc64f","expr":"callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Java array length is always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:42.418785948Z"}
{"id":"207c42fe-6d13-4854-a697-b5496d24345a","expr":"callbacks.length == 0 || callbacks[0].getClass() != null","rationale":"If the first element is not null, invoking getClass() is safe.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[]):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:42.418785948Z"}
{"id":"8742c377-3822-4c07-a20e-83f350a3421b","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"Array 'result' length equals 'callbackTypes' length as 'result' is built from each element of 'callbackTypes'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:42.556976381Z"}
{"id":"21dc3db9-f352-4948-be7c-1fb40315b410","expr":"result != null","rationale":"'result' is allocated as a new array; hence, it is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Class[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:42.556976381Z"}
{"id":"3a63b6ce-fc36-4c84-a000-8195d56e4d2a","expr":"callbacks != null && callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"The callbacks array is an array parameter and thus cannot be null or have a negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.637349042Z"}
{"id":"d379ea4a-4f3a-4fe0-ac74-e5a0a357dd07","expr":"!checkAll || callbacks.length > 0","rationale":"If checking all is enabled, it is meaningful that callbacks are not empty","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.637349042Z"}
{"id":"528f05fb-d3ac-4bb7-90cc-794d02ea1bdc","expr":"callbacks.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"Excluded trivial tautology","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.637349042Z"}
{"id":"516e27c6-06eb-4169-980a-75fdb4aecdc3","expr":"!checkAll || callbacks != null","rationale":"Safety check that callbacks is not null when checkAll is true","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.637349042Z"}
{"id":"c968ff87-ffde-4cd4-b33d-3d314b1b0ddb","expr":"!checkAll || callbacks.length >= 0","rationale":"Callbacks length is always non-negative as an array property, this invariant reflects that when checkAll is true","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.637349042Z"}
{"id":"559c2438-6b4e-4a12-b660-92a71a657f84","expr":"callbackTypes != null && callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"As callbackTypes is an array parameter, it must be non-null and its length must be zero or greater.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.746083839Z"}
{"id":"03c9ba5b-b943-40c9-b649-239a7a28224b","expr":"callbackTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:43.746083839Z"}
{"id":"f3e4bcd4-8510-472d-a81d-50091382a775","expr":"result.length == callbacks.length","rationale":"The result array length equals callbacks array length, as the method populates result based on callbacks.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:44.273836569Z"}
{"id":"e6bac670-cca4-4bd2-8b8c-1aa1293343a6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Result array is always non-null as it is allocated and returned.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:44.273836569Z"}
{"id":"bf970dad-4e72-4207-8afe-d8e67be80ad0","expr":"!checkAll || (result.length == callbacks.length)","rationale":"If checkAll is true, result length equals callbacks length (which holds anyway).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineTypes(Callback[],boolean):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:44.273836569Z"}
{"id":"08eec6dc-2c78-4e57-91dd-92932c597ad6","expr":"callback != null","rationale":"Callback parameter must be non-null as per method precondition","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.290463361Z"}
{"id":"3b105e5c-56b2-4d66-a7d5-2035f04a144c","expr":"callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"The class of callback must be non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.290463361Z"}
{"id":"b39aa79d-33fa-4049-ba23-8a68e8344b9e","expr":"checkAll == true || checkAll == false","rationale":"Boolean parameter checkAll distinct values","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.290463361Z"}
{"id":"ecc547d0-9d3f-4fba-9b1e-02d3d92d33f7","expr":"callback.getClass().isInstance(callback)","rationale":"Callback must be instance of its declared class","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.290463361Z"}
{"id":"95e00d95-953c-48a6-b861-fbfedc9cc784","expr":"!checkAll || callback.getClass() != null","rationale":"Relationship between checkAll flag and callback class non-null","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Callback,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.290463361Z"}
{"id":"f1de31bd-e9ed-4ac9-8991-a64bdcb4c13d","expr":"result.length == callbackTypes.length","rationale":"The method creates 'result' array of the same length as 'callbackTypes'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.470379339Z"}
{"id":"a59b5559-d07a-4315-aeb3-2ea4bda1babc","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null array.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.470379339Z"}
{"id":"648a9757-0a8d-43cc-a6ba-b0047da8ca16","expr":"result[0] != null || callbackTypes.length == 0","rationale":"Each element in 'result' corresponds to a generated CallbackGenerator for each callback type; if any elements exist, at least the first is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#getGenerators(Type[]):CallbackGenerator[]","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.470379339Z"}
{"id":"6f61ed9e-5486-4d74-b999-365baa4d24ab","expr":"callbackType != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null callbackType so that isAssignableFrom can be safely called.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.974296488Z"}
{"id":"fb308b4b-ac57-4e7a-bdcc-4eb5d086b7ee","expr":"callbackType.isInterface() == false","rationale":"The method checks assignability against classes, so callbackType is likely not an interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.cglib.proxy.CallbackInfo#determineType(Class,boolean):Type","file":"org/springframework/cglib/proxy/CallbackInfo.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:35:45.974296488Z"}
