{"id":"29c1d001-324b-4402-99d2-e93f10321e37","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length of bootstrap method arguments is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:10.740306945Z"}
{"id":"a1bfdf77-1ad5-4c2c-84ac-dc41a240b73c","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The name parameter should be a valid method name, typically non-null and not empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:14.406923417Z"}
{"id":"cd959420-eca9-4355-b679-6282d4699c7c","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && descriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The descriptor is a method descriptor string with parentheses indicating parameters and return type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:14.406923417Z"}
{"id":"accf83de-04f5-4227-b325-1a6cac54515e","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle != null","rationale":"Bootstrap method handle must be non-null to reference the bootstrap method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:14.406923417Z"}
{"id":"c22dfebc-bf68-4797-b30a-a6536fd512d3","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments != null","rationale":"Bootstrap method arguments array exists even if empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:14.406923417Z"}
{"id":"7f860709-fb2a-48e6-a291-b00efb7e36b8","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"bootstrapMethodArguments is an Object varargs array, so its class must be an array type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:14.406923417Z"}
{"id":"a91d1844-5070-4af7-b941-21cf233a1ab0","expr":"label != null","rationale":"Given that 'label.flags' is accessed, label must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:18.884989956Z"}
{"id":"e83d74f5-2bbf-4e51-8288-92403daf6675","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode values correspond to bytecode instruction opcodes and are non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:18.884989956Z"}
{"id":"2c215215-5f47-47df-9b1d-765e8d8c3358","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method expects a valid Label object to operate on at entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:22.794479123Z"}
{"id":"04018a52-6ec9-4844-9c90-8dc04efeff17","expr":"label.frame == null || label.frame.owner == label","rationale":"If label.frame is set, its owner should reflect the label itself at method entry.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:22.794479123Z"}
{"id":"e3d3b00b-7d4a-451d-83a1-73e893576328","expr":"label.bytecodeOffset >= 0","rationale":"Label's bytecode offset usually represents a position in bytecode which cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:22.794479123Z"}
{"id":"bf1a3e6f-a9bb-42ca-aace-4df4663edf7f","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter must not be null as it is used without null checks in the method.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:22.977270900Z"}
{"id":"019480ed-8d99-46a0-86b6-95751bd57b6b","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"Opcode should be a non-negative integer representing valid bytecode instructions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:22.977270900Z"}
{"id":"92662478-2543-4fbc-842e-36a43e561787","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The method uses 'label' without null check, so 'label' must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:25.836535231Z"}
{"id":"9b84db2f-e8a8-4382-8211-08d4b4d66676","expr":"label.frame == null || label.frame.owner == label","rationale":"At exit, frame is null or frame.owner may be label, depends on compute mode.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:25.836535231Z"}
{"id":"6f528315-b22c-4ab0-be82-6afdb87da3e9","expr":"value == null || value.getClass().isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"Value is either null or a non-primitive wrapper type (e.g., Integer, Float).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:26.794288089Z"}
{"id":"c69f97a5-500d-487e-a896-92c4ba57c9b8","expr":"varIndex >= 0 && varIndex <= 65535","rationale":"varIndex is an index for local variables and typically would be a valid local variable index in bytecode, which is non-negative and less than 2^16.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:30.899135723Z"}
{"id":"be1e9abe-655f-49f9-ba72-2675ce86384e","expr":"increment >= -32768 && increment <= 32767","rationale":"increment's value must be within signed 16-bit range to be safely stored via putShort or in the else case.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:30.899135723Z"}
{"id":"6f78c27f-e9d9-455a-b49e-244d9fefe9f2","expr":"(varIndex > 255) || (increment > 127) || (increment < -128) || ((varIndex >= 0) && (varIndex <= 255) && (increment >= -128) && (increment <= 127))","rationale":"varIndex and increment must either be in the WIDE encoding range or the narrow encoding range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:30.899135723Z"}
{"id":"50c6dde5-4da3-4a8c-808f-a4d775fb4105","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"In general, visitIincInsn is called with a non-zero increment to meaningfully increment; zero increment is pointless and typically not generated.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:30.899135723Z"}
{"id":"e010fdf8-2913-4dc1-bb1f-27027dff3c27","expr":"varIndex >= 0 && varIndex <= 65535","rationale":"The method writes varIndex as a short or byte index, so its value lies within a valid bytecode index range.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:35.523724973Z"}
{"id":"1d2f9f63-66ce-4f37-8e08-16c89ac09e6d","expr":"(varIndex <= 255 || (increment > 127 || increment < -128))","rationale":"The method branches depending on conditions on varIndex and increment limits.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:35.523724973Z"}
{"id":"cc6b0cab-a223-4dfa-bb41-d97a2988cca2","expr":"(varIndex <= 255 && increment <= 127 && increment >= -128) || (varIndex > 255 || increment > 127 || increment < -128)","rationale":"Either varIndex <= 255 and increment fits byte range for simple encoding or wide encoding is used.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:35.523724973Z"}
{"id":"1513cd02-a5e4-4dc8-9ed4-b4a1c5301578","expr":"varIndex + 1 >= 1","rationale":"Ensures the update of maxLocals if varIndex >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:35.523724973Z"}
{"id":"8f11d107-f9c1-4d00-85c2-e852be3c26bb","expr":"min <= max && max - min + 1 == labels.length && dflt != null && labels != null && labels.length > 0 && labels[0] != null && labels[labels.length - 1] != null","rationale":"Ensures the range and label array size consistency, and that labels and default label are present.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:36.928986047Z"}
{"id":"0eaaf103-7d80-440e-9988-f4cdeef3d284","expr":"isInterface == (opcode == 185)","rationale":"If opcode is INVOKEINTERFACE (185), then isInterface must be true, otherwise false.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:37.361455807Z"}
{"id":"c645e91e-148f-4a0e-a912-f20dcc56d99f","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"owner must be a valid non-null string representing the class owner.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:37.361455807Z"}
{"id":"4308f6ad-a0d4-443b-994f-8b89c1162527","expr":"name != null","rationale":"name must be a valid non-null string representing the method name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:37.361455807Z"}
{"id":"2601c733-6e93-4311-85c3-d16ad1587cf3","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"descriptor must be a valid non-null string representing the method descriptor signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:37.361455807Z"}
{"id":"e6f9ed5d-734f-4d3b-8674-2dda94862269","expr":"labels != null && keys != null && dflt != null && labels.length == keys.length","rationale":"labels and keys arrays must have the same length to index through them in the loop","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:40.478190585Z"}
{"id":"749d95a9-724c-4115-b142-8bb4a049531c","expr":"labels.length >= 0","rationale":"Length of the labels array cannot be negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:40.478190585Z"}
{"id":"51f9e493-8510-4328-bf11-d95b075706fc","expr":"keys.length >= 0","rationale":"Length of the keys array cannot be negative","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:40.478190585Z"}
{"id":"4033295d-c469-4d0b-958e-8475a7ed008e","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"dflt must not be null for method to execute correctly","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodWriter#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:41:40.478190585Z"}
