{"id":"2296366d-d983-48e2-a9ee-c6db32dd838d","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty() && !owner.contains(\".\")","rationale":"The owner string typically represents an internal class name in bytecode, which does not contain dots.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:54.507812483Z"}
