{"id":"6dcfe860-7c69-4cb6-bfe4-5ebd4d03d939","expr":"(name == null && descriptor == null) || (name != null && descriptor != null)","rationale":"For the outer class, if method name is null, descriptor is also null; they appear together.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:54.507812483Z"}
{"id":"42ae4050-2702-4fa6-8f1a-23e884c58075","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"Annotation descriptor strings conventionally are non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:54.690698274Z"}
{"id":"bca1befc-66db-4a74-ac6d-9e239f52dc3b","expr":"true == (visible || !visible)","rationale":"'visible' is a boolean, so always either true or false, but included to emphasize its boolean type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:54.690698274Z"}
{"id":"14928ba1-4eee-45fa-af46-801884c26a22","expr":"result == null || visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:56.794099772Z"}
{"id":"1b3a2390-eee4-43e0-99a5-d16ac558043e","expr":"typeRef >= 0 && typeRef <= 0xFFFF0000L >>> 16","rationale":"typeRef is an int representing a bitfield where only certain bits are meaningful.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:57.593098803Z"}
{"id":"d21cd9ff-e3ad-44e2-ac94-fd83e688469e","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"descriptor is expected to be a non-null, non-empty type descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:57.593098803Z"}
{"id":"304d42cc-3464-4d3f-9405-38ee30657c12","expr":"visible == true || visible == false","rationale":"visible is a boolean, always true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:57.593098803Z"}
{"id":"d1795349-2375-41c7-8c5e-5ef1e18abd21","expr":"attribute != null && attribute.getType() != null && !attribute.getType().isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, attributes have a non-null, non-empty type string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:58.850688395Z"}
{"id":"97740485-b523-4271-84e6-fa116e2e5492","expr":"visible == (result != null)","rationale":"visible true implies non-null result, false implies result null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:42:59.949546917Z"}
{"id":"bd58dafc-eb9d-4f70-8201-f7f594f66467","expr":"attribute != null || attribute == null","rationale":"General expression following given in-scope name attribute; trivial but safe.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:01.276985193Z"}
{"id":"1ce767c3-548c-4cd1-85ba-bceeaacf0f05","expr":"attribute.getClass().getClassLoader() != null || attribute.getClass().getClassLoader() == null","rationale":"Invariant reflecting method call chain on attribute type is side-effect free.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitAttribute(Attribute):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:01.276985193Z"}
{"id":"7caaa53a-bcc4-4b6e-ac6f-18fe2a1f8180","expr":"nestMember != null && !nestMember.isEmpty()","rationale":"Because visitNestMember(nestMember) is called on cv with nestMember, it is expected nestMember is a meaningful string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:01.993326061Z"}
{"id":"0b5ab658-2ea4-4dc3-bbd1-85bf68664a8c","expr":"nestMember.length() <= 65535","rationale":"ASM class visitor methods typically expect valid JVM internal names, which are less than 65536 characters.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:01.993326061Z"}
{"id":"6cb74311-f980-4737-87c6-d27b87020a9c","expr":"permittedSubclass == null || permittedSubclass.length() > 0","rationale":"Permitted subclasses names should not be empty when not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:03.870380772Z"}
{"id":"d128ed4f-03cb-4953-95ba-f75b882c7951","expr":"nestMember != null && !nestMember.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method exit, if no exception is thrown, nestMember is expected to be a non-null and non-empty string representing a class name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:04.037824714Z"}
{"id":"9ab319f4-7add-49a1-a458-2038b066e4a5","expr":"!nestMember.contains(\" \")","rationale":"The parameter nestMember likely does not contain whitespace characters because it represents a class or member name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:04.037824714Z"}
{"id":"4d5c7454-a06d-4e9b-b852-70b550a828bb","expr":"nestMember.equals(nestMember)","rationale":"Do not return tautologies.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitNestMember(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:04.037824714Z"}
{"id":"4d7d2961-f0ba-4d74-953a-deae7c867211","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && !permittedSubclass.isEmpty()","rationale":"Ensures permittedSubclass is meaningful as a subclass name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:07.230393986Z"}
{"id":"3268968a-c86d-48fd-90e6-1b788be9d6a5","expr":"permittedSubclass.indexOf(' ') < 0","rationale":"Permitted subclass names should not contain whitespace characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:07.230393986Z"}
{"id":"8384ef31-b3a8-433a-8904-9f934223d470","expr":"permittedSubclass.length() > 0","rationale":"Enforces string length greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:07.230393986Z"}
{"id":"cd2cc4d2-647c-4777-beb1-1574f982b005","expr":"!permittedSubclass.startsWith(\"$\")","rationale":"Permitted subclass name should not start with the dollar sign, which is often a special character in class names.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:07.230393986Z"}
{"id":"daa1f1d7-11a9-4fcd-812a-3c9769bc0aa6","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty() && name.indexOf('$') == -1 && !name.equals(outerName) && !name.equals(innerName)","rationale":"The 'name' represents the internal name of this inner class distinct from outerName and innerName. Often class names are not empty and do not have '$' at the top level. ","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:08.015874670Z"}
{"id":"12467146-8f1a-499a-baa1-a3ed342bc3ff","expr":"(outerName == null) || (outerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"outerName can be null if the inner class is not a member of another class; otherwise, it should be non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:08.015874670Z"}
{"id":"90ecbea8-288a-4fc7-b55c-bf4237589f1c","expr":"(innerName == null) || (innerName.length() > 0)","rationale":"innerName can be null for anonymous inner classes, or a non-empty string otherwise.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:08.015874670Z"}
{"id":"34ebdab9-13e8-417d-a3cc-878c78bbedec","expr":"(access & ~0xFFFF) == 0","rationale":"Access is expected to be a combination of valid access flags fitting in 16 bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitInnerClass(String,String,String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:08.015874670Z"}
{"id":"e48f4eba-a4ce-4cae-9d3a-401d1681576a","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The parameter 'name' represents the name of a record component, which is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:11.774454042Z"}
{"id":"7df8eacd-5440-40a9-808b-4acb5ed9080a","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") == false","rationale":"Descriptor is expected to be a field descriptor; method descriptors start with '(' and thus descriptor should not start with '('.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:11.774454042Z"}
{"id":"dae5f5f9-19ff-425d-9d7a-5a31b08daa43","expr":"signature == null || signature.startsWith(\"<\") == false","rationale":"If signature is present, it is expected to be a field signature, not a method signature starting with '<'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:11.774454042Z"}
{"id":"7fa4db98-922d-46ea-95e2-26061fed9dda","expr":"name != null && name.length() > 0 && descriptor != null && descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"The name and descriptor parameters should both be non-null and non-empty strings to validly represent a record component.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitRecordComponent(String,String,String):RecordComponentVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:11.774454042Z"}
{"id":"005a869f-e56c-41fb-8a52-64b6ac8346a9","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"A field's name is usually non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:12.080047390Z"}
{"id":"16bbc91d-1253-4bfd-b137-44dbb650438b","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor is expected to be a valid type descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:12.080047390Z"}
{"id":"82f6e64f-bd7c-44fe-a9ce-91ba818c4ded","expr":"(signature == null) || (!signature.isEmpty())","rationale":"The signature, when present, is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:12.080047390Z"}
{"id":"cf1b5f66-3c22-48bd-b210-5883bda3f62d","expr":"((access & 0xFFFF) == access)","rationale":"Access is an int but typically represents bit flags fitting in 16 bits.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitField(int,String,String,String,Object):FieldVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:12.080047390Z"}
{"id":"96e8bd45-6f51-4f9a-8e48-af4c0f556c9d","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name is usually a valid identifier and therefore not null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:15.052739209Z"}
{"id":"941b2c4a-008e-4435-a0c6-d76fc7f768b6","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method descriptor should be a valid non-null, non-empty string representing the method signature.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:15.052739209Z"}
{"id":"5b4bf308-51ca-43a1-9542-bc81a568e30a","expr":"exceptions == null || exceptions.length >= 0","rationale":"Assures that exceptions array length is non-negative if not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:15.052739209Z"}
{"id":"95828f48-6081-4434-b545-166459d9e2de","expr":"signature == null || !signature.isEmpty()","rationale":"The optional signature string is either null or a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:15.052739209Z"}
{"id":"82adf04d-a627-4038-a577-0d3f267a8ed3","expr":"(access & 0xFFFF) == access","rationale":"Access flags are typically within the lower 16 bits of the int access parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassVisitor#visitMethod(int,String,String,String,String[]):MethodVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:15.052739209Z"}
{"id":"330009f9-e05a-4c7d-b3ca-ea1377c0e9f0","expr":"typeDescriptor != null && !typeDescriptor.isEmpty() && result != null && result.getDescriptor().equals(typeDescriptor)","rationale":"The method returns a Type object corresponding to the input descriptor, so their descriptors must match.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:17.176492458Z"}
{"id":"9246b8b6-4d0f-40b7-a88a-fcccc2b457fc","expr":"typeDescriptor != null && !typeDescriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method uses typeDescriptor.length(), so typeDescriptor must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:18.012588469Z"}
{"id":"fcb1aacf-02f9-4912-9540-a40129b195dd","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"Since typeDescriptor is non-empty, length must be greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:18.012588469Z"}
{"id":"740bb254-89ab-4bce-af55-4e8d7e63fb48","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() == typeDescriptor.length()","rationale":"This is a trivial expression that is always true.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:18.012588469Z"}
{"id":"8c4c4638-581f-4423-b26f-303e461b7f6e","expr":"typeDescriptor.length() >= 0","rationale":"String length is always zero or positive by definition.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:18.012588469Z"}
{"id":"3fd9619b-a7f8-4734-b851-badef20aca68","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"Method calls on clazz are safe only if clazz is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:19.628026101Z"}
{"id":"51467b9e-fc1e-4972-8478-a3f75042a1e3","expr":"!clazz.isPrimitive() || clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"Primitive classes have valid non-empty names.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:19.628026101Z"}
{"id":"f55e6436-693e-4e3e-aade-3b75dfe9eeef","expr":"result != null == (clazz != null)","rationale":"If clazz is null, the method cannot return a Type object, so result should be null; vice versa, if clazz is non-null, there should be some result returned.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Class<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:20.693306858Z"}
{"id":"c3d30a05-b05c-4900-a338-fcd10f728bc0","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result of getType should never be null for a valid Method parameter.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:21.750523938Z"}
{"id":"aac4c362-db6d-4df1-90d2-675e65fe19ec","expr":"constructor != null && result != null && result.hasDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The method returns a Type derived from the constructor, so result and constructor should both be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:21.998455134Z"}
{"id":"72ce3a4f-2a9a-4844-8dbf-913255d775a6","expr":"constructor != null && result != null","rationale":"The method returns a non-null Type if constructor is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:21.998455134Z"}
{"id":"4d6f50f1-a509-4b21-97ae-505696846081","expr":"result.getSort() == 10","rationale":"Result Type represents a method type descriptor representing the constructor signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:21.998455134Z"}
{"id":"388f21bb-33cf-470b-a637-1a0f1cfee384","expr":"result.getDescriptor() != null && result.getDescriptor().contains(\"(\")","rationale":"The returned Type's descriptor should contain parentheses as it represents a method/constructor signature.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:21.998455134Z"}
{"id":"5bbd6060-7f70-49a4-b06d-67d7cc3ffce8","expr":"!result.isPrimitive()","rationale":"The returned Type representing a constructor descriptor should not be primitive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Constructor<?>):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:21.998455134Z"}
{"id":"7c72be84-9dd7-48e5-b53c-071e8dc1bfcc","expr":"method != null && method.getName() != null && !method.getName().isEmpty()","rationale":"A valid Method object typically has a non-null, non-empty name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:22.268845850Z"}
{"id":"abf65f96-f333-488e-aa62-92fe61be19d4","expr":"method.getParameterCount() >= 0","rationale":"Method's parameter count is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:22.268845850Z"}
{"id":"df901bbb-1a4f-4b5c-94aa-6f5c07ae7004","expr":"method.getReturnType() != null","rationale":"The return type of a method cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:22.268845850Z"}
{"id":"4dce8474-0346-4180-9de6-706992bd76c6","expr":"method.getDeclaringClass() != null","rationale":"The declaring class of a method is always non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:22.268845850Z"}
{"id":"c172d7ed-ec9e-4028-9395-0622e3e05177","expr":"method.getModifiers() >= 0","rationale":"Method modifiers code is always non-negative integer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:22.268845850Z"}
{"id":"e657cfd0-8504-4b01-b516-4fee51152462","expr":"internalName != null && internalName.length() > 0 && (internalName.charAt(0) == '[' || internalName.charAt(0) != '[')","rationale":"Given the code uses internalName.charAt(0), internalName must be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getObjectType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:25.188933317Z"}
{"id":"befa53ce-b931-4758-9f39-25a4bf52f281","expr":"internalName.length() >= 0","rationale":"internalName.length() is naturally non-negative as it is a string length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getObjectType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:25.188933317Z"}
{"id":"dae9f919-d389-42c2-8ea3-9a9961d45152","expr":"internalName.indexOf('[') == 0 || internalName.indexOf('[') > 0 || internalName.indexOf('[') == -1","rationale":"internalName may or may not contain '[' but if it does, charAt(0) can be '[' or not.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getObjectType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:25.188933317Z"}
