{"id":"c61598ef-6251-4768-9567-7c10fbf32ed1","expr":"argumentTypes.length >= 0","rationale":"The length of argumentTypes array should be zero or more.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:29.570592463Z"}
{"id":"ab39f003-766c-4643-91e6-adea09738263","expr":"result.getReturnType().equals(returnType)","rationale":"The returned method type must have the supplied returnType as its return type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getMethodType(Type,Type):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:29.738214212Z"}
{"id":"0178eeb4-26b1-4fe3-93fa-12acf12c98c6","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Method returns an array of Type objects, so result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:31.125863744Z"}
{"id":"4ce1bf83-3068-4f0b-889c-346d9f41737a","expr":"result.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"As result is Type[], its class should be an array type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:31.125863744Z"}
{"id":"b4337e7f-b558-4a7e-b3a0-c891ba7c580b","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes():Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:31.125863744Z"}
{"id":"d46b58f2-fce1-4f06-89c6-8fc54904b9d9","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a non-null array of Types.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:32.048944086Z"}
{"id":"7b2f5740-6bb9-40d6-b846-b0521a0edfae","expr":"result.length >= 0","rationale":"Array lengths are always zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:32.048944086Z"}
{"id":"4cc866df-0b5b-41e2-88b4-20c3f4b47e37","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && methodDescriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && methodDescriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"The method descriptor string is syntactically a valid method type descriptor starting with '(' and containing a ')'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:32.701748970Z"}
{"id":"92318fad-edae-47a4-98b2-1cfdf0936bc2","expr":"methodDescriptor.length() > 2","rationale":"Because a method descriptor of '()' is the shortest valid one, length should be greater than 2 as methodDescriptor is non-null and contains both parentheses.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:32.701748970Z"}
{"id":"37494464-cef1-40a1-80e5-7fd5a5ef32de","expr":"methodDescriptor.charAt(0) == '('","rationale":"The first character must be '(' as per JVM method descriptor conventions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:32.701748970Z"}
{"id":"e1cc7915-c74e-41e7-bcef-3ff25f395a30","expr":"methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') > methodDescriptor.indexOf('(')","rationale":"To ensure syntactical correctness, the closing parenthesis should come after the opening parenthesis.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(String):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:32.701748970Z"}
{"id":"654ffecd-7b07-420f-ba5f-e156ce181105","expr":"method != null && method.getParameterTypes() != null && method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"The method is non-null and its parameter types array exists and has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:33.497503944Z"}
{"id":"51d4ea2e-c2a0-43f5-afda-10a528daa6c8","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length >= 0","rationale":"Array length in Java is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:33.497503944Z"}
{"id":"a9fead23-5e84-441a-a44b-feab7d5f30da","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().length == method.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"Trivial truth that the length equals itself, included to highlight array length usage.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:33.497503944Z"}
{"id":"5aa793f3-16ed-46cc-8ffe-6ae3048988f6","expr":"method.getParameterTypes().getClass().isArray()","rationale":"Parameter types must be returned as an array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:33.497503944Z"}
{"id":"eb83e890-c139-404d-b0b4-60a4c369e3bf","expr":"result.length == method.getParameterTypes().length","rationale":"The method returns a Type array corresponding to method's parameter types array; therefore, lengths must be equal.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:35.030243532Z"}
{"id":"4089a1fc-d526-4b7e-aa71-01d9f7f55dc5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The implementation initializes a new Type array and returns it; so result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getArgumentTypes(Method):Type[]","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:35.030243532Z"}
{"id":"97cfebb8-0dd1-4091-b99d-32361f9cd7c2","expr":"result.getSort() >= 0 && result.getSort() <= 12","rationale":"The 'getSort' method of the Type class returns an integer indicating the type's sort, which is always in the range 0 to 12 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType():Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:36.838207089Z"}
{"id":"6a3ac63b-f119-4154-882d-1810d6498114","expr":"result.getDescriptor() != null","rationale":"The descriptor of the resulting type must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType():Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:36.838207089Z"}
{"id":"97075ef9-e151-4177-acbd-f9934bab402a","expr":"!result.equals(null)","rationale":"The returned type object 'result' is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType():Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:36.838207089Z"}
{"id":"f8778e07-08fe-4839-bf64-f0e014500305","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && methodDescriptor.length() > 0 && methodDescriptor.charAt(0) == '('","rationale":"Method descriptors in JVM format start with '(' indicating the start of parameter types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:38.381467635Z"}
{"id":"9d624ae0-292e-4b5f-9970-6b8ee241cee8","expr":"methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') > 0","rationale":"The method descriptor must include a closing parenthesis for parameter list.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:38.381467635Z"}
{"id":"655f1976-4e3c-4dac-b38e-a0dac4743516","expr":"methodDescriptor.length() >= methodDescriptor.indexOf(')') + 1","rationale":"Return type offset is at or after index of ')'.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:38.381467635Z"}
{"id":"b6897af9-c627-4933-89c7-8547adec0581","expr":"methodDescriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && methodDescriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"Ensures methodDescriptor conforms to JVM method descriptor format.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:38.381467635Z"}
{"id":"a094e263-155c-4e92-a552-9375628ffce6","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && methodDescriptor.length() > 0 && result != null && result.getDescriptor().length() > 0 && methodDescriptor.endsWith(result.getDescriptor())","rationale":"The returned Type represents the return type described at the end of the method descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.132552771Z"}
{"id":"1c772d43-959b-43be-b230-302881416aec","expr":"result.getSort() >= 0","rationale":"Type.getSort returns an ordinal representing the type category, which is expected to be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.132552771Z"}
{"id":"659e030d-04ac-4529-9fe8-79c98fe2b03b","expr":"result.getDescriptor().length() <= methodDescriptor.length()","rationale":"The return type descriptor string is a substring within the overall method descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.132552771Z"}
{"id":"786f663f-8a9f-40dd-a393-308b8484236e","expr":"!result.getDescriptor().isEmpty()","rationale":"The return type must have a valid descriptor string of length greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(String):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.132552771Z"}
{"id":"da122a12-c718-4c72-88e1-3fb6e0ef5c36","expr":"method != null && method.getReturnType() != null && method.getReturnType().isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"method.getReturnType() is never null and is a valid Class object representing the return type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.312281064Z"}
{"id":"fe7829b2-dce2-416f-949c-8bb684ba917d","expr":"method.getReturnType().isArray() == false","rationale":"The return type of the method as a Class is rarely array at method entry, so we can state that it is not an array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.312281064Z"}
{"id":"b4111e50-8efd-44f9-b9da-b1d6e55d9db4","expr":"method.getReturnType().getName() != null","rationale":"Class names are always non-null strings for valid return types.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnType(Method):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:39.312281064Z"}
{"id":"0055804e-98e7-44a0-9c97-2c9bf31f65d6","expr":"methodDescriptor != null && methodDescriptor.length() > 0 && methodDescriptor.charAt(0) == '('","rationale":"The method context and implementation comments indicate that the method descriptor string must start with '(' character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:40.116652376Z"}
{"id":"f1b3bcd2-a3cb-4fb9-9f9b-c560fe94a4c2","expr":"descriptorBegin >= 0 && descriptorBegin < descriptorBuffer.length()","rationale":"descriptorBegin is a valid index within descriptorBuffer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:41.828783180Z"}
{"id":"c433996e-78b3-4c87-999e-65d214a61e0d","expr":"descriptorEnd > descriptorBegin","rationale":"The substring length between descriptorBegin and descriptorEnd is positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:41.828783180Z"}
{"id":"39054d42-0d5a-45e1-bc0d-a266d9385e72","expr":"descriptorEnd <= descriptorBuffer.length()","rationale":"descriptorEnd is within descriptorBuffer bounds.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:41.828783180Z"}
{"id":"80e30d53-62c2-4775-a1e4-b6b68d71ad3e","expr":"descriptorBuffer != null","rationale":"descriptorBuffer is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:41.828783180Z"}
{"id":"52eccc48-13d5-448f-8652-a6afd61a5d51","expr":"result > 1 && result <= methodDescriptor.length() + 1","rationale":"The method parses the method descriptor starting at index 1 and advances the offset until after the return type. The return value 'result' must be at least 2 (since currentOffset starts at 1 and one is added at the end) and cannot exceed methodDescriptor.length() + 1.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:42.308415261Z"}
{"id":"75c1c284-3edc-46ae-91a3-e03e244d18db","expr":"methodDescriptor.charAt(result - 1) == ')' || methodDescriptor.charAt(result - 1) != '('","rationale":"The method loops until a closing ')' character is found, so the character at result - 1 index is the closing parenthesis or beyond, indicating the return type offset.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getReturnTypeOffset(String):int","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:42.308415261Z"}
{"id":"db630666-a210-446d-b867-1c89890c7b55","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned class name string is never null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:45.289203515Z"}
{"id":"5d2710f7-adb7-4938-8e0f-e2b3c95c6e70","expr":"result.length() > 0","rationale":"Class names represented by strings are non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:45.289203515Z"}
{"id":"f2b1cc87-d7c3-48a0-8750-fbfe4b6730b4","expr":"result.indexOf('/') == -1","rationale":"The returned string does not contain '/' character since it is replaced by '.' or is a primitive name.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:45.289203515Z"}
{"id":"0cce59ac-5ad0-4cbe-bc83-537677b027ba","expr":"!result.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The returned class name string does not start with '['.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getClassName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:45.289203515Z"}
{"id":"2cc000ff-9d6e-4154-95d8-f39f0ae6d28c","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Result must be non-null since the method always returns a Type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getTypeInternal(String,int,int):Type","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:45.360029511Z"}
{"id":"152c8fa4-f067-48ab-93e3-74ea51fbb079","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Substring returns a non-null String, so result must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:46.780929323Z"}
{"id":"cdf814bf-39e4-4d3a-9b11-d287850e3b93","expr":"result.length() >= 0","rationale":"Length of any String is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:46.780929323Z"}
{"id":"e1b11959-d64d-4005-85a6-b1a99501b0ba","expr":"result.indexOf('/') == result.lastIndexOf('/') || result.indexOf('/') >= 0","rationale":"Internal names use '/' as package separator but may appear one or multiple times.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:46.780929323Z"}
{"id":"e3548bf9-17a8-4ae6-bc11-de108e8f0a7f","expr":"!result.isEmpty()","rationale":"Resulting internal type name substring is expected to have length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName():String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:46.780929323Z"}
{"id":"86b04e3c-5cdf-47b2-8347-8911504da385","expr":"clazz != null","rationale":"The method requires clazz to be non-null to call clazz.getName() without NullPointerException.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.160298948Z"}
{"id":"a79461df-c680-47d7-92d9-7cf0e6933a07","expr":"clazz.isPrimitive() == false","rationale":"The method getName on primitive classes returns their names, but they do not have internal names with slashes; typically internal names are used for non-primitive classes.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.160298948Z"}
{"id":"73630fdc-f95a-49e1-a705-217141d04bd1","expr":"clazz.getName().indexOf('.') >= 0 || clazz.getName().indexOf('.') == -1","rationale":"The class name may contain '.' characters, which will be replaced with '/' in the internal name.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.160298948Z"}
{"id":"91c82eb1-a6f3-4c6a-a779-af3601c2bfe8","expr":"clazz.getName().contains(\".\") == (clazz.getName().indexOf('.') >= 0)","rationale":"Using contains and indexOf on the class name to detect '.' is consistent.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.160298948Z"}
{"id":"a6caf86a-f9c0-405d-bf6f-61296e51d849","expr":"clazz.getName().length() > 0","rationale":"A class name is expected to be a non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.160298948Z"}
{"id":"930c9a72-fcdc-4858-86e4-79869c9c54c8","expr":"clazz != null && result != null && result.equals(clazz.getName().replace('.', '/'))","rationale":"result equals clazz.getName() with '.' replaced by '/'","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.858420336Z"}
{"id":"cd1307ea-33d5-4148-bc7b-b0607195c46b","expr":"clazz != null && !result.contains(\".\")","rationale":"result cannot contain '.' because the method replaces dots with slashes.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.858420336Z"}
{"id":"11a8ce2a-812d-49dd-bcfc-8eca41d013bc","expr":"clazz != null && result.length() == clazz.getName().length()","rationale":"result length matches clazz.getName() length.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.Type#getInternalName(Class<?>):String","file":"org/springframework/asm/Type.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:43:48.858420336Z"}
