{"id":"d02b1eaa-c5df-4388-af00-164c640aef28","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The method name is expected to be a valid method identifier string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:26.965432778Z"}
{"id":"0f33bd2f-ffa3-4642-bc97-0134a29b3121","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"The class name owning the method is typically non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:26.965432778Z"}
{"id":"e94f8fcb-e96d-4692-b3d4-450f848cf496","expr":"descriptor != null && descriptor.startsWith(\"(\") && descriptor.contains(\")\")","rationale":"Method descriptors in JVM bytecode format start with '(' and contain a ')' to separate parameter and return types.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:26.965432778Z"}
{"id":"e157a814-25d3-459c-a4ed-ee3875f3bc6a","expr":"opcode == (opcode & 0xFF)","rationale":"Opcode values are within a byte range; the higher bits outside opcode-relevant bits are not set.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:26.965432778Z"}
{"id":"e80f2c5c-4d6d-483e-b2b6-83dd3ec7b84f","expr":"opcode != 0","rationale":"Opcode zero is invalid; opcode represents a valid JVM bytecode instruction.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:26.965432778Z"}
{"id":"4e95072a-b48d-4e6b-901c-e020e2782d25","expr":"owner != null && !owner.isEmpty()","rationale":"Typically, 'owner' is the internal name of the method's owner class and should not be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.037097246Z"}
{"id":"c43c8e2c-259e-4be0-ba1d-631812891b63","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'name' parameter identifies the method and should not be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.037097246Z"}
{"id":"70c101da-950b-407a-b181-c21f56fc0e73","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"A method descriptor string must be provided and should not be empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.037097246Z"}
{"id":"1d5ba6dd-7591-4ec5-8520-71f89bc4d850","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The opcode parameter must be non-negative as it represents an ASM opcode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.037097246Z"}
{"id":"57da6f5b-843b-4274-851e-ea429b663992","expr":"isInterface == (opcode == 185)","rationale":"The boolean isInterface matches true if and only if opcode equals Opcodes.INVOKEINTERFACE.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.481342578Z"}
{"id":"55e9e867-2a9c-4a95-82cd-a1b6d56707cd","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The owner string is typically non-null to indicate the class or interface.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.481342578Z"}
{"id":"54ca45b0-58ec-4c87-87b0-c8629d6da763","expr":"name != null","rationale":"The method name should always be non-null at this point.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.481342578Z"}
{"id":"b3a138db-83c0-41fa-bba0-a33ade50ac88","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"The method descriptor must be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.481342578Z"}
{"id":"31b32be9-d4b3-476f-8664-817d903fa933","expr":"opcode >= 0","rationale":"The opcode integer should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.481342578Z"}
{"id":"28984e39-283a-40a0-94b5-d76dd60b73b1","expr":"opcode >= 0 && opcode <= 255","rationale":"Opcodes for JVM instructions are in the byte range and thus between 0 and 255 inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.925749886Z"}
{"id":"4c3dc866-17cf-486c-965d-2385ccb6ed8b","expr":"label != null","rationale":"ASM methods usually expect non-null labels for jump instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.925749886Z"}
{"id":"e85b6dc0-b72f-4ec6-8606-8005a999db16","expr":"label != null && label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"Typically, label offsets are non-negative numbers representing positions in bytecode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:27.959729957Z"}
{"id":"97531f7a-88b7-477e-bbc1-22fc7de27c92","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'name' parameter is expected to be a valid method name, which should not be null or empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.429012151Z"}
{"id":"3fafc4f9-7361-4247-93f7-7aea233338e3","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The 'descriptor' parameter should be a valid method descriptor string, so non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.429012151Z"}
{"id":"170ed4a0-fcbf-4d8b-a78d-a77d3346de15","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle != null","rationale":"It's expected that the bootstrap method handle is non-null for the invokedynamic instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.429012151Z"}
{"id":"bb13b34d-7f82-45ce-ae7b-dd287628cc03","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments != null","rationale":"The bootstrap method arguments typically are provided as a non-null array, possibly empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.429012151Z"}
{"id":"31f28c9c-4108-4b3c-b128-74967a852b4d","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments.getClass().isArray()","rationale":"Because 'bootstrapMethodArguments' is passed as varargs, it should be an Object[] array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.429012151Z"}
{"id":"e9c38548-3abc-41ce-b42a-712427b9eae8","expr":"name != null && !name.isEmpty()","rationale":"Name is the method name to be invoked dynamically and is expected to be non-null and non-empty string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.870785545Z"}
{"id":"6a483f6b-7c21-4f5f-85e6-1d4e34391a78","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"Descriptor represents the method signature and should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.870785545Z"}
{"id":"895202ac-04f9-47f4-b8ed-956780646f27","expr":"bootstrapMethodHandle != null","rationale":"bootstrapMethodHandle is essential for the invokedynamic instruction and hence expected to be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.870785545Z"}
{"id":"e77e2366-9ff5-4f8c-9730-bc474a0c1ea8","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments != null","rationale":"bootstrapMethodArguments is varargs; it should never be null at method exit but can be empty.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.870785545Z"}
{"id":"ff97779a-3690-4695-beb9-7398ec02ee4a","expr":"bootstrapMethodArguments.length >= 0","rationale":"bootstrapMethodArguments is an array and its length should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInvokeDynamicInsn(String,String,Handle,Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:28.870785545Z"}
{"id":"6ba5f509-1797-4244-9154-89dfa206b1bd","expr":"label != null && label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"The input label should be non-null and have a non-negative offset at method exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLabel(Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.066748439Z"}
{"id":"f44ab2f0-cd45-4eff-8565-b3ae0261048f","expr":"owner != null","rationale":"The method expects a non-null string for the owner.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.169727464Z"}
{"id":"f6d2f3c1-b6d6-4f58-bd8f-79a1244aa6d1","expr":"name != null","rationale":"A method name string must be provided for invocation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMethodInsn(int,String,String,String,boolean):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.169727464Z"}
{"id":"2e87b748-bc60-417c-9af6-a6e616dcd1af","expr":"label != null","rationale":"The label parameter is expected to be non-null as it is passed down to another method expecting a valid label.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.458876328Z"}
{"id":"19faec3e-350c-4ded-b7ee-6a64aceafcd0","expr":"opcode >= 153 && opcode <= 168","rationale":"In ASM, jump instructions opcodes range between 153 (IFEQ) and 168 (JSR).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.458876328Z"}
{"id":"097aa8c4-d013-4624-b37f-b7adc188f6b8","expr":"! (opcode == 167 && label == null)","rationale":"The opcode 167 corresponds to GOTO, which requires a non-null label.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.458876328Z"}
{"id":"7f6f5e9d-5615-4137-a921-ac1d90441d75","expr":"label.getOffset() >= 0","rationale":"At the method exit, label's offset should be resolved and non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitJumpInsn(int,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:29.458876328Z"}
{"id":"e30327c0-5995-46a5-a7c2-df36461ec38b","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"varIndex is typically a non-negative index of the local variable to increment, as negative indices are invalid.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:30.032969887Z"}
{"id":"1eb89905-9bd4-4c9a-a1ff-c817d8535ec2","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Incrementing by zero is semantically pointless; if this method is called, increment is usually non-zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:30.032969887Z"}
{"id":"b76d13f1-9fdb-48ed-88f3-6ed6e11b9ad5","expr":"max >= min && labels != null && labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"The length of labels must correspond to the range between min and max inclusive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:30.098066752Z"}
{"id":"ed4e3e8b-d836-48fa-973a-5f208374d551","expr":"varIndex >= 0","rationale":"Local variable indexes for bytecode instructions are usually non-negative integers.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.108212030Z"}
{"id":"21964f60-11f1-4188-8c8e-095a60c3ddbe","expr":"increment != 0","rationale":"Incrementing by zero would be pointless; thus, typically not zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.108212030Z"}
{"id":"421c9d74-5a02-4600-9dcc-d211315a30f1","expr":"Math.abs(increment) <= 255","rationale":"The increment fits in a signed byte (range -128 to 127), so absolute value no more than 255 is a valid approximation.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitIincInsn(int,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.108212030Z"}
{"id":"958176bf-d37b-4053-a53c-53278eb36167","expr":"value != null","rationale":"Reflects the common use case that value passed to visitLdcInsn is not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLdcInsn(Object):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.265177337Z"}
{"id":"3b6593b3-75fb-4f1e-a3fe-be9020b9bc2b","expr":"min <= max","rationale":"For a tableswitch instruction, the minimum key cannot be greater than the maximum key.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.459380518Z"}
{"id":"c873e74d-7417-4068-8398-486b4e8c75f3","expr":"labels.length == (max - min + 1)","rationale":"In a tableswitch, the labels array length matches the number of keys from min to max.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.459380518Z"}
{"id":"45e42487-c728-45b9-af12-d4a25bf2eb61","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label for the tableswitch instruction should be non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitTableSwitchInsn(int,int,Label,Label):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.459380518Z"}
{"id":"81445324-a783-4cc8-ad42-47078532fe38","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"The keys array length must match the labels array length as per the lookup switch specification.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.595052382Z"}
{"id":"9f3579df-9718-42b6-bfb0-217a066f8bd0","expr":"dflt != null","rationale":"The default label should be non-null since the opcode requires a default target.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:31.595052382Z"}
{"id":"bef4bc14-9bd9-411b-a448-f4cbd1112761","expr":"keys != null && labels != null && dflt != null","rationale":"The method likely requires all parameters to be non-null to perform the lookup switch instruction.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:32.477653455Z"}
{"id":"41af90b0-62c6-4a4d-8692-9c8dad2a4bde","expr":"keys.length == labels.length","rationale":"The lookup switch requires a matching label for each key, implying arrays must be of the same length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:32.477653455Z"}
{"id":"5b9e9abc-9dcc-4a3b-90ee-49c94143732b","expr":"keys.length >= 1","rationale":"A lookup switch with no keys doesn't make sense; at least one key must be present.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:32.477653455Z"}
{"id":"7ee6b32d-0fe0-4c8d-80c8-5a1ff6cf17df","expr":"labels.length >= 1","rationale":"The labels array must have at least one element corresponding to keys or default label.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitLookupSwitchInsn(Label,int[],Label[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:32.477653455Z"}
{"id":"87940175-a8dd-4811-8047-9ab26f69bc9a","expr":"numDimensions > 0","rationale":"visitMultiANewArrayInsn should receive a positive number of dimensions.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.018200311Z"}
{"id":"861eb913-de7b-465a-85dd-e4661009506b","expr":"descriptor != null","rationale":"Descriptor is a non-null string representing the type.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.018200311Z"}
{"id":"8aac4acb-4b95-4f1a-8b79-19a781973c86","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor of a multi-dimensional array should begin with '['.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.018200311Z"}
{"id":"67890b65-0f91-4c51-88ba-587c1f7aae9f","expr":"numDimensions == descriptor.lastIndexOf('[') + 1","rationale":"Number of dimensions matches the count of leading '[' in descriptor string.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.018200311Z"}
{"id":"bc5f9286-2a20-4e58-aaa3-145c263adb68","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"A non-null, non-empty descriptor is expected for valid multi-dimensional array instructions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.190175955Z"}
{"id":"b5cb94e4-10e0-4078-b7f0-a97abeaf74e7","expr":"numDimensions > 0","rationale":"The number of dimensions must be greater than zero for a valid multi-dimensional array.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.190175955Z"}
{"id":"69b9302f-6be3-4cf4-973b-cee67e88624b","expr":"descriptor.startsWith(\"[\")","rationale":"The descriptor for multi-dimensional arrays starts with '[' character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.190175955Z"}
{"id":"30eeb741-ef0d-411c-917c-8d4232019604","expr":"numDimensions <= descriptor.length()","rationale":"Number of dimensions must be less than or equal to the descriptor length as the descriptor encodes the array type.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.190175955Z"}
{"id":"27d6d6a7-4de8-41ff-9676-627250142c3c","expr":"descriptor.length() > 0","rationale":"Descriptor string length must be positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitMultiANewArrayInsn(String,int):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:33.190175955Z"}
{"id":"c0866370-0447-4c49-bd80-eb58b86e39b6","expr":"result == null || (result != null && result.getClass().getClassLoader() != null)","rationale":"If result isn't null, it should have a class loader because it's a runtime object.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:34.077977498Z"}
{"id":"cf012e67-c857-4c71-b69a-bfa419ba569b","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"At method entry, descriptor should be a valid non-empty string representing the annotation descriptor.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.MethodVisitor#visitInsnAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/MethodVisitor.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:34.450800120Z"}
