{"id":"e747aeb3-48d9-4e9b-bcca-ebd71ab98463","expr":"signature == null || signature.length() > 0","rationale":"If signature is not null, it was added to symbolTable, implying it is valid non-empty UTF8.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visit(int,int,String,String,String,String[]):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:45.039148125Z"}
