{"id":"3fd39bdf-a33d-4d99-a5bf-f4b768379f1d","expr":"file == null || file.length() > 0","rationale":"If 'file' is non-null, it has been used to add a constant, implying it is a valid UTF-8 string (non-empty).","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitSource(String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:45.957575815Z"}
