{"id":"c4b9de25-75ab-4128-acae-7db24336a2d6","expr":"(name == null || descriptor == null) || (name != null && descriptor != null)","rationale":"The method conditionally sets enclosingMethodIndex only if both name and descriptor are non-null, implying if one is null, the other is null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitOuterClass(String,String,String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:46.229513927Z"}
