{"id":"60d04769-458f-48bc-a765-6c3ad701c66f","expr":"result != null && result.toString().contains(descriptor)","rationale":"The returned AnnotationVisitor corresponds to the annotation described by 'descriptor', so 'result.toString()' should include 'descriptor'.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitAnnotation(String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:47.177595508Z"}
