{"id":"523383a0-9e76-407e-a743-f2c511425028","expr":"descriptor != null && !descriptor.isEmpty()","rationale":"The descriptor string is expected to be a non-null, non-empty descriptor representing a type annotation.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitTypeAnnotation(int,TypePath,String,boolean):AnnotationVisitor","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:47.413233669Z"}
