{"id":"b32cc5b8-ebb5-4af7-87b8-80e27fe26459","expr":"permittedSubclass != null && !permittedSubclass.isEmpty()","rationale":"To safely add a constant class with permittedSubclass, it should be non-null and non-empty.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"org.springframework.asm.ClassWriter#visitPermittedSubclass(String):void","file":"org/springframework/asm/ClassWriter.java","createdAt":"2026-09-11T01:53:48.428697791Z"}
